(4529040, 642388, 61651, '<td valign="top">I really like what you captured here - so much energy in the water ripples, the swirls of red distributed throughout the composition.  What keeps this from getting a higher vote from me though, is it seems too soft focus for the subject, and grainy, like your shutter speed was just a shade too slow.  For my taste, these types of liquid shots have more impact when they have a glassy sharpness to them.  But I still appreciate your effort to present a composition that isn''t your typical water drop shot - 7.</td>', 'I really like what you captured here - so much energy in the water ripples, the swirls of red distributed throughout the composition.  What keeps this from getting a higher vote from me though, is it seems too soft focus for the subject, and grainy, like your shutter speed was just a shade too slow.  For my taste, these types of liquid shots have more impact when they have a glassy sharpness to them.  But I still appreciate your effort to present a composition that isn''t your typical water drop shot - 7.', '2008-03-01 00:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
