(4529829, 648508, 84124, '<td valign="top">How lovely!  I would have liked it even more if it were sepia.</td>', 'How lovely!  I would have liked it even more if it were sepia.', '2008-03-01 09:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529838, 652743, 61577, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the handrail to help guide your eye</td>', 'I like the use of the handrail to help guide your eye', '2008-03-01 09:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529856, 644380, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus.  My only complain is the blurred twig to the left.  What a beauty!</td>', 'Perfect focus.  My only complain is the blurred twig to the left.  What a beauty!', '2008-03-01 09:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529859, 651752, 15711, '<td valign="top">Superb portrait.  Telling and so honest.  The lighting and focus could not be more perfect.</td>', 'Superb portrait.  Telling and so honest.  The lighting and focus could not be more perfect.', '2008-03-01 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529866, 653019, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the contre jour and movement!!</td>', 'Love the contre jour and movement!!', '2008-03-01 09:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529870, 653024, 15711, '<td valign="top">What a perfect title.  Amidst the deep brooding of winter''s chill is this burst of vermillion in the trees.  WOW ( man I got poetic didn''t I?)  I like it a lot. 7</td>', 'What a perfect title.  Amidst the deep brooding of winter''s chill is this burst of vermillion in the trees.  WOW ( man I got poetic didn''t I?)  I like it a lot. 7', '2008-03-01 09:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529873, 652891, 61577, '<td valign="top">My first ten great lighting and pp.. Hope it plays well with the voters</td>', 'My first ten great lighting and pp.. Hope it plays well with the voters', '2008-03-01 09:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529880, 652618, 15711, '<td valign="top">wow - that is an excellent portrait.  Poor thing.</td>', 'wow - that is an excellent portrait.  Poor thing.', '2008-03-01 09:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529881, 651180, 20364, '<td valign="top">great action.  nice colors. 10</td>', 'great action.  nice colors. 10', '2008-03-01 09:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529883, 650919, 15711, '<td valign="top">Perfect title.  Not everybody likes HDR but you created a cool story.</td>', 'Perfect title.  Not everybody likes HDR but you created a cool story.', '2008-03-01 09:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529886, 652576, 84124, '<td valign="top">what is it?</td>', 'what is it?', '2008-03-01 09:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529887, 653012, 84124, '<td valign="top">bravo!  great catch!</td>', 'bravo!  great catch!', '2008-03-01 09:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529891, 642404, 29011, '<td valign="top">An outtake for b/w in color? Looks great. A very strong image.</td>', 'An outtake for b/w in color? Looks great. A very strong image.', '2008-03-01 09:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529905, 651139, 69368, '<td valign="top">very beautiful image! Love the fantastic colors and the composition!</td>', 'very beautiful image! Love the fantastic colors and the composition!', '2008-03-01 09:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529909, 652716, 84124, '<td valign="top">simply breathtaking!</td>', 'simply breathtaking!', '2008-03-01 09:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529911, 653070, 69368, '<td valign="top">beautiful scenery! Only the car on left distracts a tad to me</td>', 'beautiful scenery! Only the car on left distracts a tad to me', '2008-03-01 09:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529913, 652868, 64929, '<td valign="top">''</td>', '''', '2008-03-01 09:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529916, 652868, 84124, '<td valign="top">I would not have thought that two psycho rabbits going at each other in a field could make for a good photo, well done, you proved me wrong.</td>', 'I would not have thought that two psycho rabbits going at each other in a field could make for a good photo, well done, you proved me wrong.', '2008-03-01 10:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529918, 653123, 30791, '<td valign="top">woah<br/>that will make you sick</td>', 'woahthat will make you sick', '2008-03-01 10:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529921, 650067, 84124, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture!  That lead dog looks semi-crazed, he''s looking at you like you''re a big dog biscuit!</td>', 'Fantastic capture!  That lead dog looks semi-crazed, he''s looking at you like you''re a big dog biscuit!', '2008-03-01 10:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529925, 648704, 84124, '<td valign="top">always helps to have a beautiful model!</td>', 'always helps to have a beautiful model!', '2008-03-01 10:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529928, 653120, 84124, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how this will fare with the DPC crowd, but this is one of my favorite shots I''ve had the pleasure to vote on.</td>', 'I don''t know how this will fare with the DPC crowd, but this is one of my favorite shots I''ve had the pleasure to vote on.', '2008-03-01 10:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529948, 647535, 30791, '<td valign="top">ah cool the snow is bouncing off of him</td>', 'ah cool the snow is bouncing off of him', '2008-03-01 10:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529956, 653110, 30791, '<td valign="top">best eagle shot ive seen on this website<br/>owned<br/>10</td>', 'best eagle shot ive seen on this websiteowned10', '2008-03-01 10:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529960, 644777, 30791, '<td valign="top">exceptional makeup<br/>and a ring light too? i wonder who this could be</td>', 'exceptional makeupand a ring light too? i wonder who this could be', '2008-03-01 10:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529975, 652800, 68599, '<td valign="top">exquisite lighting :) 9</td>', 'exquisite lighting :) 9', '2008-03-01 10:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4529990, 652891, 30791, '<td valign="top">ahh ive been looking at this pic for like a minute now and i still cant figure out what the hell it is?<br/>a jawbreaker? <br/>well regardless you made a great photo out of a pretty mundane object 9</td>', 'ahh ive been looking at this pic for like a minute now and i still cant figure out what the hell it is?a jawbreaker? well regardless you made a great photo out of a pretty mundane object 9', '2008-03-01 10:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530044, 650067, 41357, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot (I have something with huskys) this is a -10</td>', 'fantastic shot (I have something with huskys) this is a -10', '2008-03-01 10:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530052, 652275, 41357, '<td valign="top">7 then</td>', '7 then', '2008-03-01 10:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530196, 653055, 43774, '<td valign="top">This looks a lot like Newfoundland.</td>', 'This looks a lot like Newfoundland.', '2008-03-01 11:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530325, 652466, 66952, '<td valign="top">The framing and leading line is good, but the red path is so colorful it draws the attention away from the rest of the shot.</td>', 'The framing and leading line is good, but the red path is so colorful it draws the attention away from the rest of the shot.', '2008-03-01 12:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530340, 644714, 66952, '<td valign="top">The lighting and texture is good. With moving birds, it helps to frame the shot so that there''s some extra space in front of the bird to give it some space to move into. Otherwise, it feels a bit cramped.</td>', 'The lighting and texture is good. With moving birds, it helps to frame the shot so that there''s some extra space in front of the bird to give it some space to move into. Otherwise, it feels a bit cramped.', '2008-03-01 12:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530356, 652600, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the composition. Focus is good. Doing it at night seems to work. But to my taste, you seem to have gone overboard with the HDR processing.</td>', 'I like the subject and the composition. Focus is good. Doing it at night seems to work. But to my taste, you seem to have gone overboard with the HDR processing.', '2008-03-01 12:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530364, 653052, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of photo I am pre-inclined to like. Subject, setting, composition ... But IMO you''ve gone just a little bit too far with HDR processing.</td>', 'This is the sort of photo I am pre-inclined to like. Subject, setting, composition ... But IMO you''ve gone just a little bit too far with HDR processing.', '2008-03-01 12:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530371, 651630, 66952, '<td valign="top">It''s a good start, but I think this would work better framed differently. The main horizontal line running through the image divides the image into halves, and the water closest to the camera isn''t doing much for you. I think it would work better to crop both the bottom and the left. Bring the horizon line down to about 1/3 of the way up, and get rid of everything to the left of the island. That would bring the island in closer and make the whole shot more interesting.</td>', 'It''s a good start, but I think this would work better framed differently. The main horizontal line running through the image divides the image into halves, and the water closest to the camera isn''t doing much for you. I think it would work better to crop both the bottom and the left. Bring the horizon line down to about 1/3 of the way up, and get rid of everything to the left of the island. That would bring the island in closer and make the whole shot more interesting.', '2008-03-01 12:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530375, 652965, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract. I like the lights and darks and the way they are arranged. Obviously you left (or made) this blurred and it contributes to the abstract nature of the image. But my narrow minded preference is to see something in sharp focus.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract. I like the lights and darks and the way they are arranged. Obviously you left (or made) this blurred and it contributes to the abstract nature of the image. But my narrow minded preference is to see something in sharp focus.', '2008-03-01 12:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530394, 652006, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely setting and composition. I like the dramatic sky. But IMO, from the horizon down, the post processing is too intense for me.</td>', 'Lovely setting and composition. I like the dramatic sky. But IMO, from the horizon down, the post processing is too intense for me.', '2008-03-01 12:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530423, 647945, 67585, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait.  I really like the duotone, and for me the centered comp works really well for this shot.</td>', 'This is a great portrait.  I really like the duotone, and for me the centered comp works really well for this shot.', '2008-03-01 12:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530427, 653136, 18197, '<td valign="top">The selective desat and sepia do a nice job of directing attention to the ship. At the same time, they give the photo a somewhat claustrophobic feeling ... like the world is closing in on the ship. Maybe the ship represents freedom or escape from the darker more pressing world. Lots to think about here.</td>', 'The selective desat and sepia do a nice job of directing attention to the ship. At the same time, they give the photo a somewhat claustrophobic feeling ... like the world is closing in on the ship. Maybe the ship represents freedom or escape from the darker more pressing world. Lots to think about here.', '2008-03-01 12:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530435, 650212, 67585, '<td valign="top">Hahahahaha, The title LMAO!!! too funny. What would have made this even better would be a tighter crop with the boards in the background that say "building the future...together" in view, that would have been a GREAT title.</td>', 'Hahahahaha, The title LMAO!!! too funny. What would have made this even better would be a tighter crop with the boards in the background that say "building the future...together" in view, that would have been a GREAT title.', '2008-03-01 12:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530438, 650067, 67585, '<td valign="top">Whoa...very intense. nice DOF</td>', 'Whoa...very intense. nice DOF', '2008-03-01 12:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530439, 652593, 18197, '<td valign="top">Photo is fine. well composed, captures and processed. The border distracts.</td>', 'Photo is fine. well composed, captures and processed. The border distracts.', '2008-03-01 12:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530441, 652966, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice one, David!</td>', 'Nice one, David!', '2008-03-01 12:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530442, 651764, 67585, '<td valign="top">Wow, amazing detail in the beak and feathers</td>', 'Wow, amazing detail in the beak and feathers', '2008-03-01 12:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530446, 647895, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful symmetry. I can''t wait to see what lens you used for this wide angle.</td>', 'Beautiful symmetry. I can''t wait to see what lens you used for this wide angle.', '2008-03-01 12:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530450, 650621, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this except the sky, which seems two aqua and a bit blown out. This would be a good situation for using multiple exposures.</td>', 'I like everything about this except the sky, which seems two aqua and a bit blown out. This would be a good situation for using multiple exposures.', '2008-03-01 12:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530457, 646577, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love the subject but the post processing has gone way to far IMO.</td>', 'I love the subject but the post processing has gone way to far IMO.', '2008-03-01 12:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530458, 652994, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice moment captured and nice b&amp;w conversion. I would like to be able to see the bride''s face a little better. Perhaps a little adjustment with shadows/highlights or lighten the red channel.</td>', 'Nice moment captured and nice b&w conversion. I would like to be able to see the bride''s face a little better. Perhaps a little adjustment with shadows/highlights or lighten the red channel.', '2008-03-01 12:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530459, 643622, 43405, '<td valign="top">Like the back lighting effect, just a pity that these things sometimes have a cost, being the burnt out background. Very cute though.</td>', 'Like the back lighting effect, just a pity that these things sometimes have a cost, being the burnt out background. Very cute though.', '2008-03-01 12:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530463, 652719, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not normally a fan of farm implements but I like the composition of this one. Nicely fills the fram with the subject. Colors are vibrant. You''ve pushed HDR pretty far here and mostly it works but watch the halos which are noticeable around the front tires.</td>', 'Not normally a fan of farm implements but I like the composition of this one. Nicely fills the fram with the subject. Colors are vibrant. You''ve pushed HDR pretty far here and mostly it works but watch the halos which are noticeable around the front tires.', '2008-03-01 12:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530475, 645960, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. Good lens choice. People on the move give it a lot of movement. Post processing has gone a bit too far IMO.</td>', 'Nice subject. Good lens choice. People on the move give it a lot of movement. Post processing has gone a bit too far IMO.', '2008-03-01 13:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
