(4530860, 651532, 6999, '<td valign="top">What i think we might call a really honest photo - many, I think, would urge you to have increased the contrast in the web of trees for the simple sake of impact; but I quite like the muted nature of it. No fan of the selective de-sat though, but you can''t have everything.</td>', 'What i think we might call a really honest photo - many, I think, would urge you to have increased the contrast in the web of trees for the simple sake of impact; but I quite like the muted nature of it. No fan of the selective de-sat though, but you can''t have everything.', '2008-03-01 16:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
