(4532012, 650043, 80326, '<td valign="top">It looks like it could be sharper.</td>', 'It looks like it could be sharper.', '2008-03-02 04:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532017, 649831, 88718, '<td valign="top">Looks very ghostly with the figures off to the right. Interesting HDR effect.</td>', 'Looks very ghostly with the figures off to the right. Interesting HDR effect.', '2008-03-02 04:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532019, 653097, 88718, '<td valign="top">I think that this picture could perhaps have more contrast. Nice composition. B&amp;W would have been an option</td>', 'I think that this picture could perhaps have more contrast. Nice composition. B&W would have been an option', '2008-03-02 04:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532020, 644337, 88718, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition. Pity the rose n the left has a nick ut of its "hero" petal at the back. Lovely and fresh though</td>', 'Perfect composition. Pity the rose n the left has a nick ut of its "hero" petal at the back. Lovely and fresh though', '2008-03-02 04:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532021, 651380, 88718, '<td valign="top">I wonder if the square format was the right choice. Would like to see it also in landscape. Nice exposure for the forground snow.</td>', 'I wonder if the square format was the right choice. Would like to see it also in landscape. Nice exposure for the forground snow.', '2008-03-02 04:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532023, 652894, 88718, '<td valign="top">Isn''t nature amazing. Must have been hard getting the exposure right. Would like to see a writeup on how you did it.</td>', 'Isn''t nature amazing. Must have been hard getting the exposure right. Would like to see a writeup on how you did it.', '2008-03-02 04:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532024, 652572, 88718, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a character. He makes a great model. Well composed</td>', 'Wow, what a character. He makes a great model. Well composed', '2008-03-02 04:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532027, 650306, 88718, '<td valign="top">She has beautiful eyes but for some reason they do not jump out at you. perhaps less of the upper torso may have helped ;)</td>', 'She has beautiful eyes but for some reason they do not jump out at you. perhaps less of the upper torso may have helped ;)', '2008-03-02 04:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532041, 649721, 66192, '<td valign="top">San Clemente Pier, Very nice. i love shooting this spot</td>', 'San Clemente Pier, Very nice. i love shooting this spot', '2008-03-02 04:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532057, 652579, 80326, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look quiet sharp enough and a little dark I think.</td>', 'Doesn''t look quiet sharp enough and a little dark I think.', '2008-03-02 05:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532066, 653092, 74371, '<td valign="top">This is exquisite! What could simply have been a very nice photograph was made into a stunning portrait by the softness and structured lighting (intentional or UNintentional). The cropping is perfect! The angle is right on the money. The dark background makes everything come together with a definite touch of class. Although Rembrandt comes to mind, I am not sure exactly which artist is known for the overall effect you have created here, but it doesn''t matter. This is utter perfection!<br/> <br/>I hope that if this is your daughter that you intend to blow this up to as large as you can, frame it in a very expensive heavy wooden frame and place it in a postion of prominence in your home. You have achehieved greatness!! (10) (I would give it 2-10s if that were possible!!!<br/> <br/>What an excellent job!!!</td>', 'This is exquisite! What could simply have been a very nice photograph was made into a stunning portrait by the softness and structured lighting (intentional or UNintentional). The cropping is perfect! The angle is right on the money. The dark background makes everything come together with a definite touch of class. Although Rembrandt comes to mind, I am not sure exactly which artist is known for the overall effect you have created here, but it doesn''t matter. This is utter perfection! I hope that if this is your daughter that you intend to blow this up to as large as you can, frame it in a very expensive heavy wooden frame and place it in a postion of prominence in your home. You have achehieved greatness!! (10) (I would give it 2-10s if that were possible!!! What an excellent job!!!', '2008-03-02 05:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532067, 652897, 69368, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition. I like the warm colors! this is so perfectly done; I wonder if this is Irene</td>', 'beautiful composition. I like the warm colors! this is so perfectly done; I wonder if this is Irene', '2008-03-02 05:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532069, 653076, 69368, '<td valign="top">this is a really nice portrait. LIke the tones; only I miss is some more contrast</td>', 'this is a really nice portrait. LIke the tones; only I miss is some more contrast', '2008-03-02 05:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532076, 647663, 80326, '<td valign="top">It looks over sharpened and there are quiet a few what look like, but aren''t, dust spots at the top.</td>', 'It looks over sharpened and there are quiet a few what look like, but aren''t, dust spots at the top.', '2008-03-02 05:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532077, 652632, 69368, '<td valign="top">like this title!</td>', 'like this title!', '2008-03-02 05:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532081, 652965, 69368, '<td valign="top">too bad, there is nothing in focus</td>', 'too bad, there is nothing in focus', '2008-03-02 05:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532122, 652531, 80326, '<td valign="top">Good focus and sharpness but bit unlucky about the branches on the right and the busy BG.</td>', 'Good focus and sharpness but bit unlucky about the branches on the right and the busy BG.', '2008-03-02 06:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532124, 651539, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very strong sense of action - which is admirable. I like that you''ve kept that where many people''s default preference seems to be for sharpness over all else. The slightly muted colours don''t bring much too it for me: I would imagine that either a higher saturation or a complete de-saturation and higher contrast would add still more impact. But I still like the sense of action and struggle and competition.</td>', 'Very strong sense of action - which is admirable. I like that you''ve kept that where many people''s default preference seems to be for sharpness over all else. The slightly muted colours don''t bring much too it for me: I would imagine that either a higher saturation or a complete de-saturation and higher contrast would add still more impact. But I still like the sense of action and struggle and competition.', '2008-03-02 06:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532133, 652325, 80326, '<td valign="top">Horizon''s too centered, would be good to see more of the sky IMO</td>', 'Horizon''s too centered, would be good to see more of the sky IMO', '2008-03-02 07:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532160, 651139, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Lovely composition created from the shape of the flower and stem, your positioning of it on the surface and your choice of viewpoint. Lovely lighting. The dark and shiny backdrop complements the texture of the petal beautifully. And what wonderful colour and shape!</td>', 'Lovely! Lovely composition created from the shape of the flower and stem, your positioning of it on the surface and your choice of viewpoint. Lovely lighting. The dark and shiny backdrop complements the texture of the petal beautifully. And what wonderful colour and shape!', '2008-03-02 07:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532164, 652969, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail in the eyes brings this to life!</td>', 'Lovely detail in the eyes brings this to life!', '2008-03-02 07:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532165, 650253, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fantastic portrait. Beautiful positioning of each member of the family to really convey intimacy and wonderful expressions captured on all three faces.</td>', 'Fantastic portrait. Beautiful positioning of each member of the family to really convey intimacy and wonderful expressions captured on all three faces.', '2008-03-02 07:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532167, 652474, 86799, '<td valign="top">Nice, but needs sharpness.</td>', 'Nice, but needs sharpness.', '2008-03-02 07:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532169, 653031, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely misty quality to the water - is that from a long exposure flattening out the motion? Has an interesting mood to it, a cross between serene and lonely. Nice choice of toning.</td>', 'Lovely misty quality to the water - is that from a long exposure flattening out the motion? Has an interesting mood to it, a cross between serene and lonely. Nice choice of toning.', '2008-03-02 07:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532172, 652691, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way your viewpoint combines the sculpture with the mist-shrouded buildings behind.</td>', 'I like the way your viewpoint combines the sculpture with the mist-shrouded buildings behind.', '2008-03-02 07:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532177, 652800, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful choice of background and really lovely lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful choice of background and really lovely lighting.', '2008-03-02 07:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532178, 649887, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the fluid motion and vibrant colours of the dancer and the gritty, solidity of the setting.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the fluid motion and vibrant colours of the dancer and the gritty, solidity of the setting.', '2008-03-02 07:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532180, 652107, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail in the scales and eye and nice use of shallow DOF to make the snakes coils the frame for it''s head.</td>', 'Lovely detail in the scales and eye and nice use of shallow DOF to make the snakes coils the frame for it''s head.', '2008-03-02 07:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532183, 653080, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh what lovely reflections. They create a fascinating composition and the one single horizontal of the horizon against all the verticals is really interesting.</td>', 'Oooh what lovely reflections. They create a fascinating composition and the one single horizontal of the horizon against all the verticals is really interesting.', '2008-03-02 07:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532185, 653041, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of that diffused light.</td>', 'Lovely use of that diffused light.', '2008-03-02 07:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532188, 649939, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely, I like how so much of the image is white (or nearly white) and yet those few dark pixels create an entire scene. Great composition too with all that negative space above the horizon.</td>', 'Lovely, I like how so much of the image is white (or nearly white) and yet those few dark pixels create an entire scene. Great composition too with all that negative space above the horizon.', '2008-03-02 07:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532191, 652868, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow! That''s an amazing capture, were you waiting for hours? That takes dedication! I particularly love the lighting and the way that the frost mutes the backdrop to really focus all attention on the animals. Wonderful.</td>', 'Wow! That''s an amazing capture, were you waiting for hours? That takes dedication! I particularly love the lighting and the way that the frost mutes the backdrop to really focus all attention on the animals. Wonderful.', '2008-03-02 07:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532357, 652930, 80588, '<td valign="top">Yet we send MILLIONS of dollars to other countries to protect and honor those people! Heartbreaking!</td>', 'Yet we send MILLIONS of dollars to other countries to protect and honor those people! Heartbreaking!', '2008-03-02 10:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532435, 653136, 73981, '<td valign="top">This would''ve done much better if it were all in color and not done this way. You can see the obvious parts you missed when using the layer mask...going for brown?</td>', 'This would''ve done much better if it were all in color and not done this way. You can see the obvious parts you missed when using the layer mask...going for brown?', '2008-03-02 11:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532444, 652579, 73981, '<td valign="top">Too soft IMO. Would''ve done better if more were in focus.</td>', 'Too soft IMO. Would''ve done better if more were in focus.', '2008-03-02 11:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532450, 645467, 73981, '<td valign="top">Damn you...now I have to go get hotdogs tomorrow and make chili...that looks soooooo good. It''s almost time for bed and my belly is now waking up to the sight of this...8 for making me hungry</td>', 'Damn you...now I have to go get hotdogs tomorrow and make chili...that looks soooooo good. It''s almost time for bed and my belly is now waking up to the sight of this...8 for making me hungry', '2008-03-02 11:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532455, 652573, 73981, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I think you''ve done a bit much to the eyes though. They look unnatural. This may be his real eyes...in which case he has WHITE eyes.</td>', 'Nice portrait. I think you''ve done a bit much to the eyes though. They look unnatural. This may be his real eyes...in which case he has WHITE eyes.', '2008-03-02 11:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532589, 647537, 86799, '<td valign="top">Gotta love it!  Dogs rule.  But: either dog by itself would be a great picture, IMHO.  Both in one shot would be better if they were closer to each other...I know, with dogs you don''t always get to set up a shot!  Excellent catch, anyway.  Love it.</td>', 'Gotta love it!  Dogs rule.  But: either dog by itself would be a great picture, IMHO.  Both in one shot would be better if they were closer to each other...I know, with dogs you don''t always get to set up a shot!  Excellent catch, anyway.  Love it.', '2008-03-02 13:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532594, 652275, 86799, '<td valign="top">Nice.  The figure is essential.  Good comp, contrast, detail.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice.  The figure is essential.  Good comp, contrast, detail.  Well done.', '2008-03-02 13:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532595, 653006, 86799, '<td valign="top">Looks just a little dull, like you have the saturation down.  Should be bright and punchy colorful, IMO.  Looks like fun, though!</td>', 'Looks just a little dull, like you have the saturation down.  Should be bright and punchy colorful, IMO.  Looks like fun, though!', '2008-03-02 13:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532596, 650070, 86799, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2008-03-02 13:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532679, 651977, 5816, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, Great flow.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, Great flow.', '2008-03-02 14:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532801, 652894, 30791, '<td valign="top">reminds me of that one scene from The wall, when they are singing "Goodbye blue sky"<br/>9 breathtaking photo</td>', 'reminds me of that one scene from The wall, when they are singing "Goodbye blue sky"9 breathtaking photo', '2008-03-02 15:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532802, 645418, 4517, '<td valign="top">Over saturated colours work well.</td>', 'Over saturated colours work well.', '2008-03-02 15:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532813, 641618, 66353, '<td valign="top">I wish I could separate her t-shirt from the background.</td>', 'I wish I could separate her t-shirt from the background.', '2008-03-02 15:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532819, 645486, 66353, '<td valign="top">It would have been nice with some detail in the snow</td>', 'It would have been nice with some detail in the snow', '2008-03-02 15:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532824, 649556, 4517, '<td valign="top">Cracking photo. 10</td>', 'Cracking photo. 10', '2008-03-02 15:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4532841, 644380, 66353, '<td valign="top">Very nice and - and good control of highlights. But I wish you had cloned out that branch on the left...<br/>I''ll give you a 7 - would have been an 8 without the branch.</td>', 'Very nice and - and good control of highlights. But I wish you had cloned out that branch on the left...I''ll give you a 7 - would have been an 8 without the branch.', '2008-03-02 15:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
