(4535424, 652224, 83313, '<td valign="top">He appears to be waiting and watching.</td>', 'He appears to be waiting and watching.', '2008-03-03 13:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535427, 651440, 83313, '<td valign="top">Peekaboo, I see you!</td>', 'Peekaboo, I see you!', '2008-03-03 13:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535434, 652574, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective with the skirt as a background. Well done. Might have taken the plastic nametag off, is my only minor critique.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective with the skirt as a background. Well done. Might have taken the plastic nametag off, is my only minor critique.', '2008-03-03 13:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535444, 648900, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice use of dusk to get an interesting shot. It appears a touch skewed though. There''s some banding evident in the sky, but that''s really hard to avoid in a shot like this.</td>', 'A nice use of dusk to get an interesting shot. It appears a touch skewed though. There''s some banding evident in the sky, but that''s really hard to avoid in a shot like this.', '2008-03-03 13:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535449, 652897, 83313, '<td valign="top">Really nice, it''s just not grabbing me for some reason. The subtle texture seems grainy, but that may be merely the result of downsizing the image.</td>', 'Really nice, it''s just not grabbing me for some reason. The subtle texture seems grainy, but that may be merely the result of downsizing the image.', '2008-03-03 13:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535455, 652405, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool looking, but you''ll be needing some data recovery software now.</td>', 'Cool looking, but you''ll be needing some data recovery software now.', '2008-03-03 13:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535462, 652878, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. I did a similar shot at a red light in rush hour. I''m not a fan of square crops, but that''s more of a personal preference thing than any flaw of your entry.</td>', 'Nice abstract. I did a similar shot at a red light in rush hour. I''m not a fan of square crops, but that''s more of a personal preference thing than any flaw of your entry.', '2008-03-03 13:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535464, 648176, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cigars, Bleechhh! But the photo is very good.</td>', 'Cigars, Bleechhh! But the photo is very good.', '2008-03-03 13:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535468, 650919, 32378, '<td valign="top">Very different pp for this site.  I like the feeling you captured with it.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very different pp for this site.  I like the feeling you captured with it.  Good luck.', '2008-03-03 13:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535473, 650773, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems to be lacking in some of the detail I would expect to see in such an image. Strong midday sun is tough to shoot in as well.<br/> <br/>I think there''s some more storyt to this man. Perhaps pulling back a bit in the view might tell us more.</td>', 'Seems to be lacking in some of the detail I would expect to see in such an image. Strong midday sun is tough to shoot in as well. I think there''s some more storyt to this man. Perhaps pulling back a bit in the view might tell us more.', '2008-03-03 13:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535476, 645335, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well done shot of a proud bird.</td>', 'Well done shot of a proud bird.', '2008-03-03 13:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535481, 650475, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very good title. It helps make the whole image work.</td>', 'Very good title. It helps make the whole image work.', '2008-03-03 13:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535483, 652582, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very grainy and a soft view through the foreground shrubs. No avoiding the shrubs, i''m sure, but your file size is small, indicating lots of JPEG compression. You have surely lost a lot of detail to comrpession. Check the settings for that in your image editor when you save your files.</td>', 'Very grainy and a soft view through the foreground shrubs. No avoiding the shrubs, i''m sure, but your file size is small, indicating lots of JPEG compression. You have surely lost a lot of detail to comrpession. Check the settings for that in your image editor when you save your files.', '2008-03-03 13:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535492, 651835, 83313, '<td valign="top">Bold colors and good comp. Maybe the light at a different time of day would bring out the detail in the wood some more, but I am not sure.</td>', 'Bold colors and good comp. Maybe the light at a different time of day would bring out the detail in the wood some more, but I am not sure.', '2008-03-03 14:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535495, 652954, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. The stoplight could have been a distraction, but I think it works here, wit the way you framed it all.</td>', 'Nice perspective. The stoplight could have been a distraction, but I think it works here, wit the way you framed it all.', '2008-03-03 14:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535510, 653074, 87252, '<td valign="top">Maybe a tad oversharpened. Would have been nice to see a point of focus too.</td>', 'Maybe a tad oversharpened. Would have been nice to see a point of focus too.', '2008-03-03 14:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535519, 646649, 87252, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot but too me it doesn''t really feel right. Maybe a faster shutter speed and a landscape orientation might help. (so you get more of an idea where he''s going or is coming from).</td>', 'This is a cool shot but too me it doesn''t really feel right. Maybe a faster shutter speed and a landscape orientation might help. (so you get more of an idea where he''s going or is coming from).', '2008-03-03 14:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535532, 652832, 87252, '<td valign="top">Wow, one of my faves so far.</td>', 'Wow, one of my faves so far.', '2008-03-03 14:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535537, 643683, 87252, '<td valign="top">Ha! My entry is from the Carnevale too... Great shot.</td>', 'Ha! My entry is from the Carnevale too... Great shot.', '2008-03-03 14:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535548, 652359, 87252, '<td valign="top">Would be nice to see this in colour.</td>', 'Would be nice to see this in colour.', '2008-03-03 14:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535557, 652878, 87252, '<td valign="top">This is cool but I can''t see it doing very well here, there''s not a lot of sympathy for abstracts like this, good luck!</td>', 'This is cool but I can''t see it doing very well here, there''s not a lot of sympathy for abstracts like this, good luck!', '2008-03-03 14:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535564, 645830, 32378, '<td valign="top">Wow big points on the cuteness factor, plus very well executed.</td>', 'Wow big points on the cuteness factor, plus very well executed.', '2008-03-03 14:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535565, 652719, 87252, '<td valign="top">I think the border is a bit too garish here, it distracts a lot. Also not sure how much the HDR adds to the shot.</td>', 'I think the border is a bit too garish here, it distracts a lot. Also not sure how much the HDR adds to the shot.', '2008-03-03 14:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535570, 652275, 87252, '<td valign="top">Very very cool, I''ll be interested to find out where this is.</td>', 'Very very cool, I''ll be interested to find out where this is.', '2008-03-03 14:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535582, 651767, 23430, '<td valign="top">Top half has some good colour and shapes. The boats in the foreground adds balance and interest. Just the bit of clutter bottom right takes away a bit from an otherwise a pleasing shot.</td>', 'Top half has some good colour and shapes. The boats in the foreground adds balance and interest. Just the bit of clutter bottom right takes away a bit from an otherwise a pleasing shot.', '2008-03-03 14:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535584, 641407, 87252, '<td valign="top">Wow, dark man...</td>', 'Wow, dark man...', '2008-03-03 14:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535588, 647320, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very sweet.  The composition lets you gently find the baby, so as not to disturb the slumber.</td>', 'Very sweet.  The composition lets you gently find the baby, so as not to disturb the slumber.', '2008-03-03 14:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535590, 652855, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Spoilt slightly by the shade on his face but you can still see the detail there. The DOF is just right, good blurred background and not too much of the foreground is out of focus.</td>', 'Great capture. Spoilt slightly by the shade on his face but you can still see the detail there. The DOF is just right, good blurred background and not too much of the foreground is out of focus.', '2008-03-03 14:34:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4535597, 647311, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely!</td>', 'Lovely!', '2008-03-03 14:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535600, 652590, 23430, '<td valign="top">Nice calm scene. Looks like a long exposure. Well framed to not have branches crossing over at the edges.</td>', 'Nice calm scene. Looks like a long exposure. Well framed to not have branches crossing over at the edges.', '2008-03-03 14:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535602, 652982, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I like the single isolated car, center stage, outlined by the crosswalks.</td>', 'Very cool.  I like the single isolated car, center stage, outlined by the crosswalks.', '2008-03-03 14:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535607, 652868, 23430, '<td valign="top">What an interesting shot. I like the amount of negative space and the position and size of your subject.</td>', 'What an interesting shot. I like the amount of negative space and the position and size of your subject.', '2008-03-03 14:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535612, 651835, 23430, '<td valign="top">I like the colours in this. Would have been a killer shot with a bird in the hole.</td>', 'I like the colours in this. Would have been a killer shot with a bird in the hole.', '2008-03-03 14:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535616, 653016, 23430, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught the expression well.</td>', 'You''ve caught the expression well.', '2008-03-03 14:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535619, 642826, 30982, '<td valign="top">The tenderness here is both lovely and priceless.  It appears the light was quite low but that certainly doesn''t detract from the beauty captured.  You may want to try this in B&amp;W as well.</td>', 'The tenderness here is both lovely and priceless.  It appears the light was quite low but that certainly doesn''t detract from the beauty captured.  You may want to try this in B&W as well.', '2008-03-03 14:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535620, 652610, 23430, '<td valign="top">Great high contrast shot.</td>', 'Great high contrast shot.', '2008-03-03 14:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535623, 647240, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition and nice handling of the exposure.  I always like the turn signals in these.</td>', 'Very strong composition and nice handling of the exposure.  I always like the turn signals in these.', '2008-03-03 14:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535625, 652297, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a sense of both anticipation and loneliness.  Nice.</td>', 'Has a sense of both anticipation and loneliness.  Nice.', '2008-03-03 14:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535628, 650212, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love the title.</td>', 'LOL!  Love the title.', '2008-03-03 14:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535629, 652632, 23430, '<td valign="top">The scene here is really good. It needed something in the front for added interest but the person blends in too much for me.</td>', 'The scene here is really good. It needed something in the front for added interest but the person blends in too much for me.', '2008-03-03 14:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535637, 652130, 30982, '<td valign="top">The pose is just perfect.  A young man eager yet hesitant to explore the world beyond.  A memorable picture!</td>', 'The pose is just perfect.  A young man eager yet hesitant to explore the world beyond.  A memorable picture!', '2008-03-03 14:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535638, 652988, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good to see the whole bird in one of these close-up shots. Would have been even better without the stick behind him and maybe a bit of fill in flash.</td>', 'Good to see the whole bird in one of these close-up shots. Would have been even better without the stick behind him and maybe a bit of fill in flash.', '2008-03-03 14:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535641, 651972, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like that you can see the ripples from the heat of the flames.  Fun shot!</td>', 'I like that you can see the ripples from the heat of the flames.  Fun shot!', '2008-03-03 14:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535644, 652645, 30982, '<td valign="top">Lovely place.  Though I know landscape photogs abhor the idea, I''d love to see a person in here for scale.</td>', 'Lovely place.  Though I know landscape photogs abhor the idea, I''d love to see a person in here for scale.', '2008-03-03 14:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535648, 653104, 30982, '<td valign="top">And a great picture of your son it is, too.  What an intent look!  Beautiful eyes.</td>', 'And a great picture of your son it is, too.  What an intent look!  Beautiful eyes.', '2008-03-03 14:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535653, 653024, 23430, '<td valign="top">I love the bright bird in the centre of a muted surrounding. Great focus on your bird, I could have handled him just a tad brighter I think.</td>', 'I love the bright bird in the centre of a muted surrounding. Great focus on your bird, I could have handled him just a tad brighter I think.', '2008-03-03 14:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535654, 653003, 30982, '<td valign="top">She''s pretty well hidden - it''s kind of surprise to find her there.  Great lines.</td>', 'She''s pretty well hidden - it''s kind of surprise to find her there.  Great lines.', '2008-03-03 14:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535658, 649184, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective for this shot.</td>', 'Nice perspective for this shot.', '2008-03-03 14:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535662, 650043, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely collection of old wood - I like the colors, the angles.  Good light for this shot.</td>', 'A lovely collection of old wood - I like the colors, the angles.  Good light for this shot.', '2008-03-03 14:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535663, 653074, 23430, '<td valign="top">Colours are nice as is the whole balance of the shot. I like how you held back and didn''t over process this.</td>', 'Colours are nice as is the whole balance of the shot. I like how you held back and didn''t over process this.', '2008-03-03 14:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535666, 652593, 30982, '<td valign="top">Your frame will probably not be appreciated by some of the voters.  Your subjects eyes are lovely!</td>', 'Your frame will probably not be appreciated by some of the voters.  Your subjects eyes are lovely!', '2008-03-03 14:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535675, 652845, 23430, '<td valign="top">The colour of the sky and your use of flash is very good. An improvement could have been had I think by stepping back a bit to get all of her in and a straight horizon.</td>', 'The colour of the sky and your use of flash is very good. An improvement could have been had I think by stepping back a bit to get all of her in and a straight horizon.', '2008-03-03 14:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535676, 652731, 66353, '<td valign="top">Too bad the snow is burnt out and have absolutely no detail...</td>', 'Too bad the snow is burnt out and have absolutely no detail...', '2008-03-03 14:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535681, 651439, 23430, '<td valign="top">I like this one. The soft background and burning around the edges is great.</td>', 'I like this one. The soft background and burning around the edges is great.', '2008-03-03 15:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535686, 653106, 66353, '<td valign="top">Excellent B&amp;W work - and great detail :)</td>', 'Excellent B&W work - and great detail :)', '2008-03-03 15:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535688, 650899, 23430, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene with good colours and light. Just needs a subject in there like someone riding on a horse to give it a focal point.</td>', 'Lovely scene with good colours and light. Just needs a subject in there like someone riding on a horse to give it a focal point.', '2008-03-03 15:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535696, 649556, 66353, '<td valign="top">Great perspective :)</td>', 'Great perspective :)', '2008-03-03 15:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535697, 644205, 23430, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours and that reflection is perfect. Great work.</td>', 'Very nice colours and that reflection is perfect. Great work.', '2008-03-03 15:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535698, 653043, 66353, '<td valign="top">Great timing and good processing :)</td>', 'Great timing and good processing :)', '2008-03-03 15:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535704, 645834, 23430, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition and the movement of the traffic and the lines that creates adds to it no end. My only pick is that the light is harsh but may have been helped if that centre part wasn''t in darkness.</td>', 'Fantastic composition and the movement of the traffic and the lines that creates adds to it no end. My only pick is that the light is harsh but may have been helped if that centre part wasn''t in darkness.', '2008-03-03 15:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535709, 646269, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love that she''s shoeless.  And obviously discouraged.  Wonderful pattern on the paper behind the chairs.</td>', 'I love that she''s shoeless.  And obviously discouraged.  Wonderful pattern on the paper behind the chairs.', '2008-03-03 15:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535712, 651531, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like your colors and overall dreamy effect, but a bit too blurry for my taste.</td>', 'I like your colors and overall dreamy effect, but a bit too blurry for my taste.', '2008-03-03 15:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535716, 651402, 30982, '<td valign="top">He''s adorable!!  Excellent macro.</td>', 'He''s adorable!!  Excellent macro.', '2008-03-03 15:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535785, 652593, 9462, '<td valign="top">The treatment you gave to her eyes is too obvious, it doesn''t pair well with the lighting of the image. That''s a very creative border but a bit overkill.<br/>She has a nice smile, very innocent :)</td>', 'The treatment you gave to her eyes is too obvious, it doesn''t pair well with the lighting of the image. That''s a very creative border but a bit overkill.She has a nice smile, very innocent :)', '2008-03-03 15:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535844, 651411, 9462, '<td valign="top">Haleakala crater?</td>', 'Haleakala crater?', '2008-03-03 15:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535874, 652855, 9462, '<td valign="top">Are you sure he''s not just inspecting roadkill? Cuz it looks like you''re next to a road.</td>', 'Are you sure he''s not just inspecting roadkill? Cuz it looks like you''re next to a road.', '2008-03-03 16:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535881, 648297, 9462, '<td valign="top">at her contacts?</td>', 'at her contacts?', '2008-03-03 16:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535903, 653136, 9462, '<td valign="top">Definitely not fond of the sepia selective framing. Nice composition tho...</td>', 'Definitely not fond of the sepia selective framing. Nice composition tho...', '2008-03-03 16:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535920, 647599, 9462, '<td valign="top">YUM</td>', 'YUM', '2008-03-03 16:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535935, 644431, 9462, '<td valign="top">Could definitely benefit from a bit of contrast.</td>', 'Could definitely benefit from a bit of contrast.', '2008-03-03 16:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535937, 645467, 9462, '<td valign="top">It says heartburn to me</td>', 'It says heartburn to me', '2008-03-03 16:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535958, 652948, 68599, '<td valign="top">A really great statue shot :) Usually i hate them, but this is very nice. 7</td>', 'A really great statue shot :) Usually i hate them, but this is very nice. 7', '2008-03-03 16:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4535969, 652714, 9462, '<td valign="top">Over-dodged the figure, woulda been better as a silhouette... better as in more realistic.</td>', 'Over-dodged the figure, woulda been better as a silhouette... better as in more realistic.', '2008-03-03 16:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4536013, 648299, 9462, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally care for the obvious HDR effect but this one is rather intriguing.</td>', 'I don''t normally care for the obvious HDR effect but this one is rather intriguing.', '2008-03-03 17:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4536028, 652910, 66515, '<td valign="top">a little underexposed in the hair. A bit of light would help. (otherwise you''d blow out the rest of the shot if you just adjusted the exposure). I''d like to see a tight shot of the butterfly on her stomach. Overall a great idea and well done.</td>', 'a little underexposed in the hair. A bit of light would help. (otherwise you''d blow out the rest of the shot if you just adjusted the exposure). I''d like to see a tight shot of the butterfly on her stomach. Overall a great idea and well done.', '2008-03-03 17:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4536029, 644441, 77838, '<td valign="top">"A bit frayed...but STILL FLYING!!" This makes me proud to be an American.<br/> <br/>Your framing is great here.  You can see the ball &amp; truck (on top), down to the bearings below.  Your coloring is spot on too.  Very nice -Brandon</td>', '"A bit frayed...but STILL FLYING!!" This makes me proud to be an American. Your framing is great here.  You can see the ball & truck (on top), down to the bearings below.  Your coloring is spot on too.  Very nice -Brandon', '2008-03-03 17:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4536031, 653011, 66515, '<td valign="top">Don''t really care for the title but otherwise this is a great capture.</td>', 'Don''t really care for the title but otherwise this is a great capture.', '2008-03-03 17:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4536032, 653008, 66515, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if the hill in the foreground works for me. I''d like to see this shot from the other side of it. Nice sky and good contrast in the monument itself.</td>', 'I am not sure if the hill in the foreground works for me. I''d like to see this shot from the other side of it. Nice sky and good contrast in the monument itself.', '2008-03-03 17:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4536039, 650212, 66515, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop would be nice. Using the caption in the background would have been humourous and have more impact I think than the one you chose.</td>', 'A tighter crop would be nice. Using the caption in the background would have been humourous and have more impact I think than the one you chose.', '2008-03-03 17:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4536041, 651411, 66515, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line. Sky is a bit over dark in the left hand corner. (Not sure if that was created in post or using a filter). Nice rich colors otherwise though.</td>', 'Nice leading line. Sky is a bit over dark in the left hand corner. (Not sure if that was created in post or using a filter). Nice rich colors otherwise though.', '2008-03-03 17:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4536093, 653056, 66515, '<td valign="top">For me there is actually two pictures here. I''d like to see the bottom half as its own picture. It would have the swan fill the frame better and she would have more impact. Right now my eye is drawn to the top half of the frame and looking at the bottom is almost an afterthought.</td>', 'For me there is actually two pictures here. I''d like to see the bottom half as its own picture. It would have the swan fill the frame better and she would have more impact. Right now my eye is drawn to the top half of the frame and looking at the bottom is almost an afterthought.', '2008-03-03 18:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4536096, 645292, 66515, '<td valign="top">I am going to bet this is Larus. Regardless of who is is I enjoy this shot. I like the reflection on the water and the green cast on the snow. There seems to be some vignetting but I think thats because the aurora isn''t lighting up that part of the sky and consequently the reflection is dark as well. <br/> <br/>Nice image!</td>', 'I am going to bet this is Larus. Regardless of who is is I enjoy this shot. I like the reflection on the water and the green cast on the snow. There seems to be some vignetting but I think thats because the aurora isn''t lighting up that part of the sky and consequently the reflection is dark as well.  Nice image!', '2008-03-03 18:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4536098, 653136, 66515, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the selective sepia treatment you applied here. It seems quite arbitrary and draws your eye away from the subject.</td>', 'I don''t really like the selective sepia treatment you applied here. It seems quite arbitrary and draws your eye away from the subject.', '2008-03-03 18:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4536104, 645418, 66515, '<td valign="top">My first comment was going to be this: "I like the colors but they are far oversaturated in my opinion."<br/> <br/>By the time I wrote that however, my opinion changed. I still think the colors are oversaturated but it works well here.  There is a surreal look and feel to this shot that is enjoyable. <br/> <br/>I like the leading lines created by the water as well as the silhouetted trees in the distance.</td>', 'My first comment was going to be this: "I like the colors but they are far oversaturated in my opinion." By the time I wrote that however, my opinion changed. I still think the colors are oversaturated but it works well here.  There is a surreal look and feel to this shot that is enjoyable.  I like the leading lines created by the water as well as the silhouetted trees in the distance.', '2008-03-03 18:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4536110, 652218, 66515, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop would have been nice here. I would have eliminated the people at least. Otherwise a nice capture with a good sense of motion and action.</td>', 'A tighter crop would have been nice here. I would have eliminated the people at least. Otherwise a nice capture with a good sense of motion and action.', '2008-03-03 18:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
