(4537603, 653113, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is interesting, as I was experimenting with some similar shots a couple of weeks ago. Trying to photograph some plants I''ve been rooting. I think the subject blends into the background a little too much, and there''s not a lot of fine detail. Shooting through glass may account for some of that.</td>', 'This is interesting, as I was experimenting with some similar shots a couple of weeks ago. Trying to photograph some plants I''ve been rooting. I think the subject blends into the background a little too much, and there''s not a lot of fine detail. Shooting through glass may account for some of that.', '2008-03-04 13:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
