(4538870, 647924, 83313, '<td valign="top">Somebody is a proud parent! Unfortunately, the sharpest point of focus appears to be on the sweater rather than the face. Pretty good, other than that, and a cute kid.</td>', 'Somebody is a proud parent! Unfortunately, the sharpest point of focus appears to be on the sweater rather than the face. Pretty good, other than that, and a cute kid.', '2008-03-04 22:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538876, 652921, 83313, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped it a little shorter and wider, it might help the comp, but that''s a nitpick. This is a nicely detailed shot and pretty good.</td>', 'I might have cropped it a little shorter and wider, it might help the comp, but that''s a nitpick. This is a nicely detailed shot and pretty good.', '2008-03-04 22:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538885, 653093, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very fun! The edges almost look oversharp against the sky, like he was cut and pasted into it, though I do not think that is the case.</td>', 'Very fun! The edges almost look oversharp against the sky, like he was cut and pasted into it, though I do not think that is the case.', '2008-03-04 22:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
