(4540046, 652574, 20577, '<td valign="top">When I look at this picture I get very dizzy. As a matter of fact, the first time I saw it I was standing up and I got so dizzy I ended up falling down, hitting my head on a table which knocked me out and when I woke up I realized I had... well, pooped in my brand new pants! For that...you get a ONE!</td>', 'When I look at this picture I get very dizzy. As a matter of fact, the first time I saw it I was standing up and I got so dizzy I ended up falling down, hitting my head on a table which knocked me out and when I woke up I realized I had... well, pooped in my brand new pants! For that...you get a ONE!', '2008-03-05 08:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4540078, 645335, 80608, '<td valign="top">Good Sharpness,<br/>Nice composition<br/> <br/>Smelling a Ribbon here! 9</td>', 'Good Sharpness,Nice composition Smelling a Ribbon here! 9', '2008-03-05 09:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4540080, 648777, 80608, '<td valign="top">Love the colors!</td>', 'Love the colors!', '2008-03-05 09:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
