(4543582, 647945, 77192, '<td valign="top">Awwww :-) From her face I can see there is a lot of love in your relationship and I hope for many more happy years together for you.</td>', 'Awwww :-) From her face I can see there is a lot of love in your relationship and I hope for many more happy years together for you.', '2008-03-06 14:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
