(4544629, 651411, 39675, '<td valign="top">You serious brah!  How you stay? Dis foto is choke good.  It broke da eyes. I wish I can take foto like dat... no can.  Who dat hauoli gurl walkin on our aina.  I stoked about your chances brah.  Shootz Din.</td>', 'You serious brah!  How you stay? Dis foto is choke good.  It broke da eyes. I wish I can take foto like dat... no can.  Who dat hauoli gurl walkin on our aina.  I stoked about your chances brah.  Shootz Din.', '2008-03-07 03:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544636, 652873, 23430, '<td valign="top">You''ve got it all here. Colour on colour, complimentary colours and a good composition. I like the water drops as well.</td>', 'You''ve got it all here. Colour on colour, complimentary colours and a good composition. I like the water drops as well.', '2008-03-07 03:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544639, 645292, 23430, '<td valign="top">Very striking shot. The reflection is awesome. Only held back a bit by the foreground clutter.</td>', 'Very striking shot. The reflection is awesome. Only held back a bit by the foreground clutter.', '2008-03-07 03:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544645, 652441, 23430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful high contrasting colours. Seems cropped a bit too much on the right side but that doesn''t stop it being an awesome shot.</td>', 'Beautiful high contrasting colours. Seems cropped a bit too much on the right side but that doesn''t stop it being an awesome shot.', '2008-03-07 03:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544648, 643394, 68956, '<td valign="top">You''ve chosen a lovely subject, well observed:) I think it would help your image if the main subject was less centrally placed in the picture. Either composing it differently as you take it or using cropping later. Watch the background too - it''s quite busy and the snow is competing too much with that of your subject - not always the solution, but try shooting from different directions and heights to give your subject a bit more isolation. I like what you''ve seen there and you''ve captured the snow flake detail well :)</td>', 'You''ve chosen a lovely subject, well observed:) I think it would help your image if the main subject was less centrally placed in the picture. Either composing it differently as you take it or using cropping later. Watch the background too - it''s quite busy and the snow is competing too much with that of your subject - not always the solution, but try shooting from different directions and heights to give your subject a bit more isolation. I like what you''ve seen there and you''ve captured the snow flake detail well :)', '2008-03-07 03:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544674, 652897, 88825, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! Very well done :)</td>', 'I love this shot! Very well done :)', '2008-03-07 04:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544744, 653135, 6999, '<td valign="top">Austerely beautiful image. One of very few genuinely striking images int his month''s lot. Bravo.</td>', 'Austerely beautiful image. One of very few genuinely striking images int his month''s lot. Bravo.', '2008-03-07 06:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544745, 650621, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent detailing here, and I''m kind of pleased you haven''t resorted to the rather obvious and rather over-often-done HDR tricks to ''deal with'' that sky; let us see photography, rather than tricksy processing. It has, as imagery, a rther ancient quality to it, oddly.</td>', 'Excellent detailing here, and I''m kind of pleased you haven''t resorted to the rather obvious and rather over-often-done HDR tricks to ''deal with'' that sky; let us see photography, rather than tricksy processing. It has, as imagery, a rther ancient quality to it, oddly.', '2008-03-07 06:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544746, 652605, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great image; dramatic, radical (at least for here) and highly dynamic. Has a sense of motion, of relationships, of reality. Slightly crazy too, which is always good.</td>', 'Great image; dramatic, radical (at least for here) and highly dynamic. Has a sense of motion, of relationships, of reality. Slightly crazy too, which is always good.', '2008-03-07 06:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544747, 652857, 6999, '<td valign="top">The Albert Embankment? Judging from the streetlights and the edge of what looks like Millbank Tower. I like the drama of the high contrast.</td>', 'The Albert Embankment? Judging from the streetlights and the edge of what looks like Millbank Tower. I like the drama of the high contrast.', '2008-03-07 06:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544774, 647581, 69109, '<td valign="top">Excellent "nature morte" literally (in French).</td>', 'Excellent "nature morte" literally (in French).', '2008-03-07 07:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544785, 642581, 69109, '<td valign="top">Excellent. The snow is perhaps not white enough. With a bit more contrast, the snowflakes would have been more visible. But excellent!</td>', 'Excellent. The snow is perhaps not white enough. With a bit more contrast, the snowflakes would have been more visible. But excellent!', '2008-03-07 07:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544794, 650583, 1024, '<td valign="top">The best part of this photo is the warm inviting lights in the background.  Like standing out in the freezing cold, but have a warm place beaconing you.</td>', 'The best part of this photo is the warm inviting lights in the background.  Like standing out in the freezing cold, but have a warm place beaconing you.', '2008-03-07 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544796, 648343, 1024, '<td valign="top">What a great leading line!  Gorgeous sky too.</td>', 'What a great leading line!  Gorgeous sky too.', '2008-03-07 07:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544797, 648286, 1024, '<td valign="top">Such intensity, that is the stare that could stop someone right in their tracks.</td>', 'Such intensity, that is the stare that could stop someone right in their tracks.', '2008-03-07 07:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544800, 650095, 1024, '<td valign="top">This would be gorgeous without the hiker, but that splash of red totally makes this for me, it adds an additional element to your run of the mill landscape.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'This would be gorgeous without the hiker, but that splash of red totally makes this for me, it adds an additional element to your run of the mill landscape.  Very nicely done!', '2008-03-07 08:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544801, 652107, 1024, '<td valign="top">Wow, such detail.  I believe I have never seen a snake this close.  Look at all those holes in his face, one must be for breathing, but what is the other one?</td>', 'Wow, such detail.  I believe I have never seen a snake this close.  Look at all those holes in his face, one must be for breathing, but what is the other one?', '2008-03-07 08:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544803, 650178, 91103, '<td valign="top">With or without the border very nice shot, good luck with the scoring.</td>', 'With or without the border very nice shot, good luck with the scoring.', '2008-03-07 08:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544806, 652988, 90495, '<td valign="top">Clear and sharp. No clouds to distract the eye. I don''t mind the branch up top, it only helps to establish size and habitat.</td>', 'Clear and sharp. No clouds to distract the eye. I don''t mind the branch up top, it only helps to establish size and habitat.', '2008-03-07 08:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544815, 652108, 90495, '<td valign="top">I still love to see beautiful sunsets and sunrises and this is one of them. The contrast is just right, my eyes went directly to the sky because of the dark almost silhouetted landscape.</td>', 'I still love to see beautiful sunsets and sunrises and this is one of them. The contrast is just right, my eyes went directly to the sky because of the dark almost silhouetted landscape.', '2008-03-07 08:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544819, 651547, 90495, '<td valign="top">Good use of natural light for this pet-port.</td>', 'Good use of natural light for this pet-port.', '2008-03-07 08:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544826, 646649, 90495, '<td valign="top">Bad spelling will cost you. wink<br/>Although I do feel motion in this it could''ve been more emphasized. Try panning the subject for more motion blur and clicking when the subject is more on an angle to the camera.<br/>The bike <u>and</u> the bg are out of focus. Were you moving as well?</td>', 'Bad spelling will cost you. winkAlthough I do feel motion in this it could''ve been more emphasized. Try panning the subject for more motion blur and clicking when the subject is more on an angle to the camera.The bike and the bg are out of focus. Were you moving as well?', '2008-03-07 08:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544829, 647464, 90495, '<td valign="top">Would have been nice to see both jumpers in the same position but great shot just the same.</td>', 'Would have been nice to see both jumpers in the same position but great shot just the same.', '2008-03-07 08:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4544836, 652893, 90495, '<td valign="top">I rarely see this type of portrait work but this one does.</td>', 'I rarely see this type of portrait work but this one does.', '2008-03-07 08:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
