(4545132, 646187, 811, '<td valign="top">great composition and clarity in this.  nicely done.</td>', 'great composition and clarity in this.  nicely done.', '2008-03-07 10:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545134, 652700, 811, '<td valign="top">great blues</td>', 'great blues', '2008-03-07 10:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545142, 642581, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the "old" feeling this shot has.  Also, you have done well at presenting the "depth" in this shot so that it doesn''t feel flat.</td>', 'I really like the "old" feeling this shot has.  Also, you have done well at presenting the "depth" in this shot so that it doesn''t feel flat.', '2008-03-07 10:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545153, 653136, 67258, '<td valign="top">I find this almost bizarre, and visually confusing.  The partial desat gives the appearance of a hoarding, rather than a real scene(which may of course, have been part of your intent).  It is an interesting idea, but for me doesn''t work on an aesthetic level, coming across as somewhat gimicky.  On a technical level,  there appears to be a masking error at the third-fourth link in from the left, although looking again it may be part of one of the clouds.</td>', 'I find this almost bizarre, and visually confusing.  The partial desat gives the appearance of a hoarding, rather than a real scene(which may of course, have been part of your intent).  It is an interesting idea, but for me doesn''t work on an aesthetic level, coming across as somewhat gimicky.  On a technical level,  there appears to be a masking error at the third-fourth link in from the left, although looking again it may be part of one of the clouds.', '2008-03-07 10:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545165, 652980, 67258, '<td valign="top">The high key type effect doesn''t work for me here, appearing more as a result of poor exposure control than as a deliberate intention.  It is a technique I haven''t mastered, but must explore - and please don''t let my comments put you off experimenting - some work, some don''t, and some work for some people and not for others....</td>', 'The high key type effect doesn''t work for me here, appearing more as a result of poor exposure control than as a deliberate intention.  It is a technique I haven''t mastered, but must explore - and please don''t let my comments put you off experimenting - some work, some don''t, and some work for some people and not for others....', '2008-03-07 10:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545169, 649284, 811, '<td valign="top">good detail.  he looks a bit bored. :)</td>', 'good detail.  he looks a bit bored. :)', '2008-03-07 10:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545171, 644180, 811, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of the light and I like the composition</td>', 'Lovely use of the light and I like the composition', '2008-03-07 10:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545174, 652777, 67258, '<td valign="top">Something doesn''t look quite right here, but not being familiar with the bird <b>I</b> may be wrong.  I would hazard that you have used a heavy dose of noise reduction, coupled with fairly agressive sharpening - there is a very visible halo around the bird''s beak and the top of it''s head.</td>', 'Something doesn''t look quite right here, but not being familiar with the bird I may be wrong.  I would hazard that you have used a heavy dose of noise reduction, coupled with fairly agressive sharpening - there is a very visible halo around the bird''s beak and the top of it''s head.', '2008-03-07 10:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545183, 649939, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the negative space and the high level of contrast.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the negative space and the high level of contrast.', '2008-03-07 10:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545267, 651139, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very attractive - all that darkness around the bloom, with a hint of reflection.  Shallow DOF is an excellent choice.  I think this is very well done - started with a 9, bumping you to 10.</td>', 'Very attractive - all that darkness around the bloom, with a hint of reflection.  Shallow DOF is an excellent choice.  I think this is very well done - started with a 9, bumping you to 10.', '2008-03-07 10:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545274, 647581, 61651, '<td valign="top">I very much like how you framed this, and the image''s wintry tones.</td>', 'I very much like how you framed this, and the image''s wintry tones.', '2008-03-07 10:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545293, 651180, 61651, '<td valign="top">Not your typical surfing action shot, I think - there''s a just-right level of sharpness (not oversharp) in the main subject, and that subject is far enough away from the lens that it doesn''t overwhelm the overall composition.  Nice arrangement of elements in this composition, with softness/sharpness in all the right places.  Tonal distribution is good too.  Have you figured out I like it already?  :) &lt;apologies for wordiness&gt;</td>', 'Not your typical surfing action shot, I think - there''s a just-right level of sharpness (not oversharp) in the main subject, and that subject is far enough away from the lens that it doesn''t overwhelm the overall composition.  Nice arrangement of elements in this composition, with softness/sharpness in all the right places.  Tonal distribution is good too.  Have you figured out I like it already?  :) <apologies for wordiness>', '2008-03-07 10:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545295, 649537, 61651, '<td valign="top">I feel like I could pluck them and sweet music would play.  Understated and lovely.</td>', 'I feel like I could pluck them and sweet music would play.  Understated and lovely.', '2008-03-07 11:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545301, 647537, 70107, '<td valign="top">haha this made me laugh out loud.<br/>Your dogs are so cute</td>', 'haha this made me laugh out loud.Your dogs are so cute', '2008-03-07 11:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545303, 652943, 60495, '<td valign="top">That is a icy cold scene, glad I am not out in that.  I always find ice coated trees interesting but  hard to give them wow when it comes to taking pictures. For me I thinks the angle of this shot is just to generic and feels more like a snap shot. I think changing angles to get a more of an abstract feel and adding some lighting to help bring out the colors may have helped.</td>', 'That is a icy cold scene, glad I am not out in that.  I always find ice coated trees interesting but  hard to give them wow when it comes to taking pictures. For me I thinks the angle of this shot is just to generic and feels more like a snap shot. I think changing angles to get a more of an abstract feel and adding some lighting to help bring out the colors may have helped.', '2008-03-07 11:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545305, 652868, 70107, '<td valign="top">Wow. That must have been neat to witness.<br/>Cool shot</td>', 'Wow. That must have been neat to witness.Cool shot', '2008-03-07 11:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
