(4545806, 646704, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cutre pose; I think you needed a smidge more DOF so the eyes and entire beak would be in focus.</td>', 'Cutre pose; I think you needed a smidge more DOF so the eyes and entire beak would be in focus.', '2008-03-07 14:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545810, 649400, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s a heck of a pose.</td>', 'That''s a heck of a pose.', '2008-03-07 14:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545813, 644777, 74559, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and frightening all at once! Love your lighting, great expression on the model!</td>', 'Beautiful and frightening all at once! Love your lighting, great expression on the model!', '2008-03-07 14:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545822, 645834, 74559, '<td valign="top">I just love this! Great POV, crystal clear, and those lights -- double decker bus?? Very cool!!</td>', 'I just love this! Great POV, crystal clear, and those lights -- double decker bus?? Very cool!!', '2008-03-07 14:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545827, 652618, 65234, '<td valign="top">Poor, scarred dog.  Looks so sad.</td>', 'Poor, scarred dog.  Looks so sad.', '2008-03-07 14:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545830, 642458, 74559, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the colors and clarity you''ve achieved with your processing! Beautiful scene as well. I''d rather not see the blown out bits in the sky but that''s a small thing, this is really a wonderful image!</td>', 'I absolutely love the colors and clarity you''ve achieved with your processing! Beautiful scene as well. I''d rather not see the blown out bits in the sky but that''s a small thing, this is really a wonderful image!', '2008-03-07 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545835, 645335, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light!</td>', 'Beautiful light!', '2008-03-07 14:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545836, 652006, 74559, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable colors in the water, I really love it! Very interesting coastline, would love to be there :-)</td>', 'Unbelievable colors in the water, I really love it! Very interesting coastline, would love to be there :-)', '2008-03-07 14:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545839, 653106, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail.</td>', 'Very nice detail.', '2008-03-07 14:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545840, 653066, 74559, '<td valign="top">Fabulous capture, the golden light streaming through contrasts so well with the cool blue of the water, excellent detail in the rock face as well! One of my favs :-)</td>', 'Fabulous capture, the golden light streaming through contrasts so well with the cool blue of the water, excellent detail in the rock face as well! One of my favs :-)', '2008-03-07 14:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545843, 652275, 50695, '<td valign="top">Tremendous. Heaven is reaching for us, pointing to us and through us.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Tremendous. Heaven is reaching for us, pointing to us and through us. ', '2008-03-07 14:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545846, 649831, 74559, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition, wonderful processing, great sky colors, the ghostly folks are perfect... this is fantastic!</td>', 'Perfect composition, wonderful processing, great sky colors, the ghostly folks are perfect... this is fantastic!', '2008-03-07 14:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545848, 652271, 50695, '<td valign="top">brilliant mixture of sports and iconography. I''ve never seen this, or rather I''ve seen this many times and never knew I was seeing it until you showed me.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'brilliant mixture of sports and iconography. I''ve never seen this, or rather I''ve seen this many times and never knew I was seeing it until you showed me. ', '2008-03-07 14:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545851, 652568, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awesome beastie!</td>', 'Awesome beastie!', '2008-03-07 14:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545853, 653080, 50695, '<td valign="top">I am sick of this shot, but you did it perfectly. Beyond perfectly, as if the genre were invented for this photo. the title is very fitting.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'I am sick of this shot, but you did it perfectly. Beyond perfectly, as if the genre were invented for this photo. the title is very fitting. ', '2008-03-07 14:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545855, 652888, 74559, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and detail, very nicely done!!</td>', 'Nice focus and detail, very nicely done!!', '2008-03-07 14:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545860, 653093, 74559, '<td valign="top">That''s some underbite, very cute! Really nice detail, this is great :-)</td>', 'That''s some underbite, very cute! Really nice detail, this is great :-)', '2008-03-07 14:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545863, 642581, 68546, '<td valign="top">love it! Looks like a painting. Great eye for spotting this frame</td>', 'love it! Looks like a painting. Great eye for spotting this frame', '2008-03-07 14:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545868, 653066, 68546, '<td valign="top">beautiful! nice composition and juxtapose of warm and cool colours</td>', 'beautiful! nice composition and juxtapose of warm and cool colours', '2008-03-07 14:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545873, 652993, 50695, '<td valign="top">Yes. Yes. Yes. There are gods and angels who live among us, and you found them. You brought them, living, to my eyes, cupped in your subjects like the water of youth in trembling hands.<br/> <br/>You knew dpc would not understand, right? They would not see the connection between the windows in the back and the window of light this couple dwells in. They would not see the essential difference of light between his face and hers, as he gazes upon her, as she gazes upon them. They will not notice her step towards the piano, as though frozen in a movement toward music, or climbing into a plane to some country Humphrey Bogart will never see again. They will not see the strange, painful, chaotic love of the guitar for the piano. They may not even notice where the epiphany is inscribed. Nor will they realize that the trees through the windows are the very ones out of which humanity climbed in order to hunt on the plains, to shake spears and cavort in cocktail lounges.<br/> <br/>But you submitted it anyway, to be dismissed, to be forgotten, to be tinkled with advice about being too close to the edge. It is the essential cruelty that parents cannot avoid, the introduction of creation to Creation. I commend you for that, and I award you this worthless intangible shred, the Posthumous Blue Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/> <br/> <br/>(they also did not notice that her right arm is missing, and stamped with a dark cross... perhaps a price she had to pay. I wonder if she also sold away her voice, like the mermaid.)</td>', 'Yes. Yes. Yes. There are gods and angels who live among us, and you found them. You brought them, living, to my eyes, cupped in your subjects like the water of youth in trembling hands. You knew dpc would not understand, right? They would not see the connection between the windows in the back and the window of light this couple dwells in. They would not see the essential difference of light between his face and hers, as he gazes upon her, as she gazes upon them. They will not notice her step towards the piano, as though frozen in a movement toward music, or climbing into a plane to some country Humphrey Bogart will never see again. They will not see the strange, painful, chaotic love of the guitar for the piano. They may not even notice where the epiphany is inscribed. Nor will they realize that the trees through the windows are the very ones out of which humanity climbed in order to hunt on the plains, to shake spears and cavort in cocktail lounges. But you submitted it anyway, to be dismissed, to be forgotten, to be tinkled with advice about being too close to the edge. It is the essential cruelty that parents cannot avoid, the introduction of creation to Creation. I commend you for that, and I award you this worthless intangible shred, the Posthumous Blue Ribbon.   (they also did not notice that her right arm is missing, and stamped with a dark cross... perhaps a price she had to pay. I wonder if she also sold away her voice, like the mermaid.)', '2008-03-07 14:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545875, 652969, 68546, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and expression, the sepia makes it look a little underexposed and dirty. But that''s just my opinion, I prefer sepia on a low key shot. I think the crop is good, would maybe prefer a little more room above her head?</td>', 'Nice lighting and expression, the sepia makes it look a little underexposed and dirty. But that''s just my opinion, I prefer sepia on a low key shot. I think the crop is good, would maybe prefer a little more room above her head?', '2008-03-07 14:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545878, 652568, 68546, '<td valign="top">This looks like a wide angle lens so you must have got pretty close! Really nice shot.</td>', 'This looks like a wide angle lens so you must have got pretty close! Really nice shot.', '2008-03-07 14:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545879, 651180, 68546, '<td valign="top">great composition and lighting on this one!</td>', 'great composition and lighting on this one!', '2008-03-07 14:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545887, 651977, 68546, '<td valign="top">I assume the third reprents the stage of pregnancy as well as composition. I did a 3 month shoot with my wife this week and you''ve done a great job with the lighting and materials. very nice indeed.</td>', 'I assume the third reprents the stage of pregnancy as well as composition. I did a 3 month shoot with my wife this week and you''ve done a great job with the lighting and materials. very nice indeed.', '2008-03-07 14:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545890, 644380, 74559, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture of a beautiful animal! You would think it was posing for you, really great angle and wonderful detail, the snow drift in front creates such a nice opposing line to the bunny''s back; I wouldn''t mind losing the out-of-focus twig on the left, but that''s a small detail, I love this image lots!</td>', 'Amazing capture of a beautiful animal! You would think it was posing for you, really great angle and wonderful detail, the snow drift in front creates such a nice opposing line to the bunny''s back; I wouldn''t mind losing the out-of-focus twig on the left, but that''s a small detail, I love this image lots!', '2008-03-07 14:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545894, 650919, 68546, '<td valign="top">A little over HDR''d for my taste.</td>', 'A little over HDR''d for my taste.', '2008-03-07 14:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545897, 651604, 74559, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful, looks like a delicate jellyfish!</td>', 'Very beautiful, looks like a delicate jellyfish!', '2008-03-07 14:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545900, 647408, 68546, '<td valign="top">wow!! This is amazing</td>', 'wow!! This is amazing', '2008-03-07 14:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545903, 652777, 68546, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve used some kind of noise reduction on this and it''s destroyed all the detail and texture?</td>', 'I think you''ve used some kind of noise reduction on this and it''s destroyed all the detail and texture?', '2008-03-07 14:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545909, 652953, 89723, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorite pictures during this challenge. It really shows the emotion that grandparents have for their grandchildren and how grandchildren typically react to it. The use of light in this photo was great. I liked the way the light was focused on the child, yet allowed for the expression of others to be viewed. I assume this was a spontaneous shot and will be cherished forever. Great Job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-08 08:25:34.</i></td>', 'This was one of my favorite pictures during this challenge. It really shows the emotion that grandparents have for their grandchildren and how grandchildren typically react to it. The use of light in this photo was great. I liked the way the light was focused on the child, yet allowed for the expression of others to be viewed. I assume this was a spontaneous shot and will be cherished forever. Great Job!', '2008-03-07 14:40:45.000000', '2008-03-08 08:25:34.000000', 1),
(4545913, 651422, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice clarity in the sky, nice silhouette, the birds (?) at this size become dots, but difficult - wish this was 720.</td>', '8 - Nice clarity in the sky, nice silhouette, the birds (?) at this size become dots, but difficult - wish this was 720.', '2008-03-07 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545950, 653055, 25218, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity</td>', 'Nice clarity', '2008-03-07 15:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4545955, 652996, 25218, '<td valign="top">I think not having the figures off to the side would have made for a more pleasing composition.</td>', 'I think not having the figures off to the side would have made for a more pleasing composition.', '2008-03-07 15:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
