(4546788, 653115, 86447, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.  The PP is perfect.  One of only three 10s for me this time.</td>', 'Fabulous.  The PP is perfect.  One of only three 10s for me this time.', '2008-03-07 21:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
