(4546801, 652965, 32767, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I''d be surprised if this doesn''t win the Posthumous Ribbon for the Free Study.</td>', 'Cool shot. I''d be surprised if this doesn''t win the Posthumous Ribbon for the Free Study.', '2008-03-07 21:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
