(4546803, 652543, 60915, '<td valign="top">Gunnar, you amaze me! : )</td>', 'Gunnar, you amaze me! : )', '2008-03-07 21:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546805, 652334, 60915, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully stark and minimalistic! : )</td>', 'Wonderfully stark and minimalistic! : )', '2008-03-07 21:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546809, 652575, 60915, '<td valign="top">Nice choice for B&amp;W.</td>', 'Nice choice for B&W.', '2008-03-07 21:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546817, 652785, 60915, '<td valign="top">What an amazing structure! It seems neverending, dissapearing into the mist like that! Very cool!</td>', 'What an amazing structure! It seems neverending, dissapearing into the mist like that! Very cool!', '2008-03-07 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546829, 652271, 60915, '<td valign="top">This is a great perspective, and I really like those two wet footprints on the platform. : )</td>', 'This is a great perspective, and I really like those two wet footprints on the platform. : )', '2008-03-07 21:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546837, 652926, 60915, '<td valign="top">Great abstract! Very intriguing! : )</td>', 'Great abstract! Very intriguing! : )', '2008-03-07 21:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546862, 652892, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice scene.  Perhaps cropping this tighter at the bottom to eliminate the slightly distracting road, may have made this a stronger image (although you may prefer it in), and also 720 if the quality was there would have given more impact.  Nice sky/clouds.  Like the distant focus.  Looks like something ''odd'' happening in the trees just to the right of the pole, could be pp, but apologies in advance if wrong.</td>', 'Nice scene.  Perhaps cropping this tighter at the bottom to eliminate the slightly distracting road, may have made this a stronger image (although you may prefer it in), and also 720 if the quality was there would have given more impact.  Nice sky/clouds.  Like the distant focus.  Looks like something ''odd'' happening in the trees just to the right of the pole, could be pp, but apologies in advance if wrong.', '2008-03-07 21:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546892, 643912, 85886, '<td valign="top">Compositionally really good and appealing.  Interest from her curves/nudity plus the great ink.  Personally I''d like to see the colours a bit more punchy,</td>', 'Compositionally really good and appealing.  Interest from her curves/nudity plus the great ink.  Personally I''d like to see the colours a bit more punchy,', '2008-03-07 22:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546895, 647599, 85886, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!  Firstly it''s original and that''s a breath of fresh air, secondly the colour and detail is fabulous...really appealing and very much eye candy.  Thirdly the shapes are ace.  Great job on the lighting and DoF too.  I hope this does well for you to reward your creativity.</td>', 'I love this photo!  Firstly it''s original and that''s a breath of fresh air, secondly the colour and detail is fabulous...really appealing and very much eye candy.  Thirdly the shapes are ace.  Great job on the lighting and DoF too.  I hope this does well for you to reward your creativity.', '2008-03-07 22:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546899, 652119, 85886, '<td valign="top">I''m going to hazard a guess and wonder if this is Jeff and either the most fabulous DC evening or purple gradient mapping ;)  In any case lovely shot.  The colour is magical but doesn''t look too artificial (well, maybe just a bit in the really dark clouds) and the reflections add plenty of interest.</td>', 'I''m going to hazard a guess and wonder if this is Jeff and either the most fabulous DC evening or purple gradient mapping ;)  In any case lovely shot.  The colour is magical but doesn''t look too artificial (well, maybe just a bit in the really dark clouds) and the reflections add plenty of interest.', '2008-03-07 22:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546905, 651380, 85886, '<td valign="top">They better be real stars this time :)  Interesting and unusual perspective.  I really like the various textures and lines that lead the eye up the photograph - feels like an unconventional landscape but still a very appealing one.  Actually, this feels a bit like a moonscape to me.  Nice work.</td>', 'They better be real stars this time :)  Interesting and unusual perspective.  I really like the various textures and lines that lead the eye up the photograph - feels like an unconventional landscape but still a very appealing one.  Actually, this feels a bit like a moonscape to me.  Nice work.', '2008-03-07 22:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546908, 650735, 85886, '<td valign="top">Wow - how come your planet is so much closer to the moon than mine??!  I can see why this got asked for validation just because it''s such a ''wow'' shot.  The composition is great but there''s a couple of things that I think could improve this shot...the lighting on the tree is just a bit too strong...feels like a softer light would have been less harsh...the other thing is that the moon could be just a tad more contrasty.  Two relatively nitpicky points but I think with a re-edit this could really be a jawdropper of a photo.  Well done!</td>', 'Wow - how come your planet is so much closer to the moon than mine??!  I can see why this got asked for validation just because it''s such a ''wow'' shot.  The composition is great but there''s a couple of things that I think could improve this shot...the lighting on the tree is just a bit too strong...feels like a softer light would have been less harsh...the other thing is that the moon could be just a tad more contrasty.  Two relatively nitpicky points but I think with a re-edit this could really be a jawdropper of a photo.  Well done!', '2008-03-07 22:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546912, 652289, 85886, '<td valign="top">Just a great shot - obviously fantastic composition...nothing I can add other than nicely done!!</td>', 'Just a great shot - obviously fantastic composition...nothing I can add other than nicely done!!', '2008-03-07 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546915, 651604, 85886, '<td valign="top">If that''s you Slippy, the Title Police are on their way :P</td>', 'If that''s you Slippy, the Title Police are on their way :P', '2008-03-07 22:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546923, 652894, 85886, '<td valign="top">Very impressive...I think "The Phoenix" might have been a better title but nevertheless a real eye opener of a photo, even for an aurora.  Well done.</td>', 'Very impressive...I think "The Phoenix" might have been a better title but nevertheless a real eye opener of a photo, even for an aurora.  Well done.', '2008-03-07 22:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546927, 652820, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, that''s so sweet.  Wonderful body language on the mom.</td>', 'Oh, that''s so sweet.  Wonderful body language on the mom.', '2008-03-07 22:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546932, 652915, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft light and perfect DOF.  The curves pull me in nicely.</td>', 'Lovely soft light and perfect DOF.  The curves pull me in nicely.', '2008-03-07 22:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546934, 652848, 61961, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Can''t think of anything to improve it!  Would love to see this ribbon, hope I can help. :-)</td>', 'Great shot.  Can''t think of anything to improve it!  Would love to see this ribbon, hope I can help. :-)', '2008-03-07 22:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546937, 652891, 61961, '<td valign="top">Curious photo -- I''d like to know how you did this.  I''ve bumped this up as high as I can go!</td>', 'Curious photo -- I''d like to know how you did this.  I''ve bumped this up as high as I can go!', '2008-03-07 22:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546940, 644380, 61961, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t like frames, especially thick ones, but I have a sense that in this case the frame improves this photo (not that it needed much improving).  Crop seems a bit tight, but still this gets a high score from me.</td>', 'Normally I don''t like frames, especially thick ones, but I have a sense that in this case the frame improves this photo (not that it needed much improving).  Crop seems a bit tight, but still this gets a high score from me.', '2008-03-07 22:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546943, 652868, 65234, '<td valign="top">OMG!  That''s an amazing thing to capture.  I can''t imagine too many people have seen bunnies boxing each other.  Bet they weren''t playing, either.</td>', 'OMG!  That''s an amazing thing to capture.  I can''t imagine too many people have seen bunnies boxing each other.  Bet they weren''t playing, either.', '2008-03-07 22:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546945, 653041, 61961, '<td valign="top">Compelling photo, definitely makes one look twice.  The duotone treatment doesn''t seem gratuitous (as it so often does to me).  Are they sisters, or is the background a photo?  Or maybe they don''t really look alike and that''s all in my head!  High vote from me, good luck --</td>', 'Compelling photo, definitely makes one look twice.  The duotone treatment doesn''t seem gratuitous (as it so often does to me).  Are they sisters, or is the background a photo?  Or maybe they don''t really look alike and that''s all in my head!  High vote from me, good luck --', '2008-03-07 22:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546946, 652824, 61961, '<td valign="top">I love the tones in this color photo and the beautiful light.  Such an appealing shot -- I hope you didn''t "black out" too much of the background.</td>', 'I love the tones in this color photo and the beautiful light.  Such an appealing shot -- I hope you didn''t "black out" too much of the background.', '2008-03-07 22:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546949, 652873, 61961, '<td valign="top">Normally I''m not a big fan of flower photos, but there''s something about the bold colors that grab me.</td>', 'Normally I''m not a big fan of flower photos, but there''s something about the bold colors that grab me.', '2008-03-07 22:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546950, 652906, 90495, '<td valign="top">Crisp focus and a wonderful beast as a subject. The dark bg works very well here with his light coat and antlers. Good job!</td>', 'Crisp focus and a wonderful beast as a subject. The dark bg works very well here with his light coat and antlers. Good job!', '2008-03-07 22:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546953, 651411, 61961, '<td valign="top">Terrific photo, the path is quite dramatic, as are the deep color of eath and sky, and the one patch of "unnatural" color in the hiker''s shirt.  Really conveys the sense of adventure, altitude and clear mountain air.</td>', 'Terrific photo, the path is quite dramatic, as are the deep color of eath and sky, and the one patch of "unnatural" color in the hiker''s shirt.  Really conveys the sense of adventure, altitude and clear mountain air.', '2008-03-07 22:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546954, 652572, 61961, '<td valign="top">What a handsome face, great character, and the subdued color and gray bokeh gives it an almost old-Hollywood sheen.  Well done.</td>', 'What a handsome face, great character, and the subdued color and gray bokeh gives it an almost old-Hollywood sheen.  Well done.', '2008-03-07 22:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546956, 652321, 90495, '<td valign="top">Clouds could have been darkened by burning, unless you absolutely wanted them like that.</td>', 'Clouds could have been darkened by burning, unless you absolutely wanted them like that.', '2008-03-07 22:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546957, 653092, 61961, '<td valign="top">Sweet, the extreme softness really works well.  Beautiful darks and lights, it has the air of an old master.</td>', 'Sweet, the extreme softness really works well.  Beautiful darks and lights, it has the air of an old master.', '2008-03-07 23:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4546960, 652878, 65234, '<td valign="top">That makes for a nice abstract.</td>', 'That makes for a nice abstract.', '2008-03-07 23:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
