(4546982, 652878, 77838, '<td valign="top">This looks like vehicle break lights but that would mean your camera was being held at a 45 degree angle.  That in itself is not bad but the white pole going up the middle makes me think that this photo is in it''s correct orientation.  <br/> <br/>So with that in mind I''m not sure what the orange colored lights are?!!  Cool blurry effect. -Brandon</td>', 'This looks like vehicle break lights but that would mean your camera was being held at a 45 degree angle.  That in itself is not bad but the white pole going up the middle makes me think that this photo is in it''s correct orientation.   So with that in mind I''m not sure what the orange colored lights are?!!  Cool blurry effect. -Brandon', '2008-03-07 23:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
