(4547188, 652574, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7.  Liked the perspective.  There is innocence in this image.  Her blue eyes are beautiful and my main criticism was that the focus was not as sharp on them as other areas in the image.  Depending what you had to work with, perhaps a little more skirt included too and a bit more ''around'' her, as the out of focus skirt creates a nice effect.</td>', 'I gave this a 7.  Liked the perspective.  There is innocence in this image.  Her blue eyes are beautiful and my main criticism was that the focus was not as sharp on them as other areas in the image.  Depending what you had to work with, perhaps a little more skirt included too and a bit more ''around'' her, as the out of focus skirt creates a nice effect.', '2008-03-08 00:41:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547194, 652893, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8.  Nice candid moment and I have to say, the dog is my favorite.  Mainly the vignetting a little more subtle around the heads, would have made this even better in my opinion (and a more refined crop bottom right).  Nice image.</td>', 'I gave this an 8.  Nice candid moment and I have to say, the dog is my favorite.  Mainly the vignetting a little more subtle around the heads, would have made this even better in my opinion (and a more refined crop bottom right).  Nice image.', '2008-03-08 00:43:57.000000', NULL, 0),
