(4547307, 645384, 30982, '<td valign="top">What Don said, and then some.  Your model is perfect for photography - classic good looks, and the ability to project soul even with his eyes closed.  Use this guy often, please.  For photography, I mean.</td>', 'What Don said, and then some.  Your model is perfect for photography - classic good looks, and the ability to project soul even with his eyes closed.  Use this guy often, please.  For photography, I mean.', '2008-03-08 02:04:22.000000', NULL, 0),
