(4547320, 653115, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmygoodness, Ken!  All your pier and lighthouse photos are spectacular, but you totally outdid yourself on this one.   I''m still gasping in disbelief at how beautiful this is!<br/> <br/>MEGA CONGRATULATIONS!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ohmygoodness, Ken!  All your pier and lighthouse photos are spectacular, but you totally outdid yourself on this one.   I''m still gasping in disbelief at how beautiful this is! MEGA CONGRATULATIONS! ', '2008-03-08 02:08:41.000000', NULL, 0),
