(4547324, 649556, 24454, '<td valign="top">I''m so happy for you winning your first ribbon and personal best score.  If you keep turning out work like this, I doubt it will be your one and only ribbon for long :)   CONGRATULATIONS!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I''m so happy for you winning your first ribbon and personal best score.  If you keep turning out work like this, I doubt it will be your one and only ribbon for long :)   CONGRATULATIONS! ', '2008-03-08 02:10:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547326, 652011, 7969, '<td valign="top">very nice...where is this?</td>', 'very nice...where is this?', '2008-03-08 02:11:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547332, 652868, 7969, '<td valign="top">wow love this shot, the waiting and watching is just as fun as getting the shot eh?<br/>glad you waited it out.</td>', 'wow love this shot, the waiting and watching is just as fun as getting the shot eh?glad you waited it out.', '2008-03-08 02:14:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547333, 652800, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the warmth of this.  It''s perfectly presented.  Clean, crisp, nice light to provide depth, creative.  It''s a top 20, and the commenter score is well above 8.  It''s not a sweeping wide-angle landscape, does not involve a sunset or northern lights or a crystal clear reflection of a dramatic sky.  99.5% of us can''t achieve what you do with shots like this.  The other 0.5% includes IreneM - she''s the one you need to ask.</td>', 'I like the warmth of this.  It''s perfectly presented.  Clean, crisp, nice light to provide depth, creative.  It''s a top 20, and the commenter score is well above 8.  It''s not a sweeping wide-angle landscape, does not involve a sunset or northern lights or a crystal clear reflection of a dramatic sky.  99.5% of us can''t achieve what you do with shots like this.  The other 0.5% includes IreneM - she''s the one you need to ask.', '2008-03-08 02:14:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547343, 653115, 44877, '<td valign="top">Far, far OUT, Ken!! I just got home and see you have a RED! Congratulations - very cool!! And very well deserved, too. This image is stunningly beautiful. I bet you''re buzzing right now - awesome. <br/> <br/>Alicia</td>', 'Far, far OUT, Ken!! I just got home and see you have a RED! Congratulations - very cool!! And very well deserved, too. This image is stunningly beautiful. I bet you''re buzzing right now - awesome.  Alicia', '2008-03-08 02:19:18.000000', NULL, 0),
