(4547486, 652790, 49109, '<td valign="top">The shot itself is nice, I like the shallow DOF,  but you pushed the saturation of the flower too far, it lost almost all of it''S details</td>', 'The shot itself is nice, I like the shallow DOF,  but you pushed the saturation of the flower too far, it lost almost all of it''S details', '2008-03-08 04:35:38.000000', NULL, 0),
