(4547611, 650253, 46097, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve been a bit harsh on yourself. I think this is excellent......one of the best baby portraits i''ve seen in a long time, and child photography is so hard. I really like the arc of eye contact, and I find the colouring and lighting subtle but very effective. And of course, a gorgeous baby and cute expression really helps too!</td>', 'I think you''ve been a bit harsh on yourself. I think this is excellent......one of the best baby portraits i''ve seen in a long time, and child photography is so hard. I really like the arc of eye contact, and I find the colouring and lighting subtle but very effective. And of course, a gorgeous baby and cute expression really helps too!', '2008-03-08 06:33:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547612, 649556, 43191, '<td valign="top">wow, this is beautiful!</td>', 'wow, this is beautiful!', '2008-03-08 06:35:12.000000', NULL, 0),
