(4547617, 649515, 39850, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and warm colors for such a cold scene.  Nice elevated position to capture the fog well.  Nice scene, although it being a stadium or arena of some description perhaps makes the scene a bit more ''ordinary''.  The best aspect of this image in my opinion is the fog, so I do wonder about a variation in subject to allow that to dominate the image, almost totally - but that is a different image.  Obviously your choice to photograph the fog covering this building/scene.  Framing works well, and does make it look like a still from a movie.  It is a shame to receive no comments during a Challenge, especially with a fine photograph.  I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, perhaps a 6 or 7. <i>edit:typo</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-08 07:03:15.</i></td>', 'Nice lighting and warm colors for such a cold scene.  Nice elevated position to capture the fog well.  Nice scene, although it being a stadium or arena of some description perhaps makes the scene a bit more ''ordinary''.  The best aspect of this image in my opinion is the fog, so I do wonder about a variation in subject to allow that to dominate the image, almost totally - but that is a different image.  Obviously your choice to photograph the fog covering this building/scene.  Framing works well, and does make it look like a still from a movie.  It is a shame to receive no comments during a Challenge, especially with a fine photograph.  I didn''t get to this during voting, but hypothetically, perhaps a 6 or 7. edit:typo', '2008-03-08 06:43:22.000000', '2008-03-08 07:03:15.000000', 0),
