(4547852, 653115, 82092, '<td valign="top">Very happy for you on this one. I knew it was beautiful and you doubted it :oP I say it a lot but you truly are great at having a vision for an image and not stoping until it is perfect. Congratulations on your red and new pb! Wishing you many more in the future.</td>', 'Very happy for you on this one. I knew it was beautiful and you doubted it :oP I say it a lot but you truly are great at having a vision for an image and not stoping until it is perfect. Congratulations on your red and new pb! Wishing you many more in the future.', '2008-03-08 09:21:46.000000', NULL, 0),
