(4547932, 641531, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is terrific. I can''t imagine why no one felt inclined to comment (I didn''t get around to voting in this challenge). I like the way it gradually pulls your eye deeper and deeper into it, starting with the ground, the trees and hills, the low clouds and finally the sky itself. (And who would give this a one?!)</td>', 'This is terrific. I can''t imagine why no one felt inclined to comment (I didn''t get around to voting in this challenge). I like the way it gradually pulls your eye deeper and deeper into it, starting with the ground, the trees and hills, the low clouds and finally the sky itself. (And who would give this a one?!)', '2008-03-08 10:19:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547933, 648704, 63269, '<td valign="top">neat processing!</td>', 'neat processing!', '2008-03-08 10:20:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547937, 650253, 42013, '<td valign="top">Great job Aimee, i think these types of portraits are very hard...yours is beautiful.</td>', 'Great job Aimee, i think these types of portraits are very hard...yours is beautiful.', '2008-03-08 10:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547943, 650398, 76335, '<td valign="top">Very well composed -- the wicker surface, vase, flowers and wallpaper all coordinate nicely. And the colors are fantastic. It looks like the flowers are brushing against the wall on the left -- that''s a little distracting to me. Also, I would like to have seen clearer focus.</td>', 'Very well composed -- the wicker surface, vase, flowers and wallpaper all coordinate nicely. And the colors are fantastic. It looks like the flowers are brushing against the wall on the left -- that''s a little distracting to me. Also, I would like to have seen clearer focus.', '2008-03-08 10:24:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547944, 652451, 42013, '<td valign="top">I agree, shouldn''t have to search so far for this one. Looks like you had a great trip Alex. I"m more than a little jealous.</td>', 'I agree, shouldn''t have to search so far for this one. Looks like you had a great trip Alex. I"m more than a little jealous.', '2008-03-08 10:24:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547945, 652865, 55822, '<td valign="top">I would have to agree about the eyes. I really think that if they had been in focus you would have scored much higher. Overall however I really like the feel of this shot. Kinda gives me the creeps. In a good way.</td>', 'I would have to agree about the eyes. I really think that if they had been in focus you would have scored much higher. Overall however I really like the feel of this shot. Kinda gives me the creeps. In a good way.', '2008-03-08 10:24:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547951, 652865, 22970, '<td valign="top">I think a different crop to let the mask take up the frame and better focus on the eyes may have helped. Hope you didn''t mind but I did a quick edit to illustrate what I''m trying to say.<br/> <br/>[thumb]655704[/thumb]<br/> <br/>Hope this helps</td>', 'I think a different crop to let the mask take up the frame and better focus on the eyes may have helped. Hope you didn''t mind but I did a quick edit to illustrate what I''m trying to say. [thumb]655704[/thumb] Hope this helps', '2008-03-08 10:28:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547952, 652865, 48697, '<td valign="top">Part of me really likes the composition and then part of me would like to see the rest of the eye in the frame, though I don''t find that to be an issue with this shot.  As stated by the previous commentors, the eyes are lacking focus.  I''m sure it has to do with the fact you had to use a slow shutter because of the available lighting but the main focus in portraits tend to be the eyes, moreso in the case of closeup portraits such as this.  I would have voted this between a 5 or 6  as is but if the eyes were sharp it would have been a 7, maybe an 8.  Hope that helps!</td>', 'Part of me really likes the composition and then part of me would like to see the rest of the eye in the frame, though I don''t find that to be an issue with this shot.  As stated by the previous commentors, the eyes are lacking focus.  I''m sure it has to do with the fact you had to use a slow shutter because of the available lighting but the main focus in portraits tend to be the eyes, moreso in the case of closeup portraits such as this.  I would have voted this between a 5 or 6  as is but if the eyes were sharp it would have been a 7, maybe an 8.  Hope that helps!', '2008-03-08 10:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547953, 653113, 63269, '<td valign="top">Fasinating!</td>', 'Fasinating!', '2008-03-08 10:29:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547954, 644777, 30791, '<td valign="top">well done, i really liked this photo</td>', 'well done, i really liked this photo', '2008-03-08 10:29:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547977, 652865, 61961, '<td valign="top">James/Jimi, don''t be discouraged by the low score.  This is a group that votes tough  -- it can take some getting used to.  FYI, I passed on voting for this photo.<br/> <br/>I notice the eyes look a little red, though that''s probably just an illusion caused by the red on the mask.  To me the bigger negative is the glare on the mask.<br/></td>', 'James/Jimi, don''t be discouraged by the low score.  This is a group that votes tough  -- it can take some getting used to.  FYI, I passed on voting for this photo. I notice the eyes look a little red, though that''s probably just an illusion caused by the red on the mask.  To me the bigger negative is the glare on the mask.', '2008-03-08 10:37:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547991, 651752, 7743, '<td valign="top">I think you captured your father''s mood perfectly in this portrait.</td>', 'I think you captured your father''s mood perfectly in this portrait.', '2008-03-08 10:43:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4547999, 652965, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very engaging shot. Love how you still filled the frame with the light Beautiful picture and you should be thrilled.</td>', 'Very engaging shot. Love how you still filled the frame with the light Beautiful picture and you should be thrilled.', '2008-03-08 10:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4548002, 647329, 7743, '<td valign="top">My eye is drawn directly to the tulip on the left (brightest area of the photo).  I think the issue is that that tulip is out of focus.  The tulip in focus is in the shadows and not drawing much attention.</td>', 'My eye is drawn directly to the tulip on the left (brightest area of the photo).  I think the issue is that that tulip is out of focus.  The tulip in focus is in the shadows and not drawing much attention.', '2008-03-08 10:50:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4548006, 653016, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very original shot. I like the candidness of if as well and the photojournalism aspects. Very good combo. Looks like the tykes first time playing the drums. :)</td>', 'Very original shot. I like the candidness of if as well and the photojournalism aspects. Very good combo. Looks like the tykes first time playing the drums. :)', '2008-03-08 10:53:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4548007, 652297, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is the most beautiful shot I have seen in ages.  As Jon pointed out, there is a nostalgic almost sad feel to it, like an old Bogart movie or a voyage on the Titanic.  This may be your very best photo to date (IMHO of course).<br/> <br/>Black and white absolutely MAKES this photo. If I can seen it in voting (I did not make it all the way through) it would have scored a 10.<br/> <br/>In all honesty, I am not surprised that it is yours.</td>', 'This is the most beautiful shot I have seen in ages.  As Jon pointed out, there is a nostalgic almost sad feel to it, like an old Bogart movie or a voyage on the Titanic.  This may be your very best photo to date (IMHO of course). Black and white absolutely MAKES this photo. If I can seen it in voting (I did not make it all the way through) it would have scored a 10. In all honesty, I am not surprised that it is yours.', '2008-03-08 10:53:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4548011, 645384, 62318, '<td valign="top">Magnificent lighting and the pose is just perfect. You were definitely robbed, this is easily 6 material. I''m blaming the "drinking-bird" voters on this one.</td>', 'Magnificent lighting and the pose is just perfect. You were definitely robbed, this is easily 6 material. I''m blaming the "drinking-bird" voters on this one.', '2008-03-08 10:54:43.000000', NULL, 0),
