(4548657, 648777, 67145, '<td valign="top">OMG OMG !!!<br/>FIRST PLACE .. CONGRATULATIONS ... !!!!!!!!!<br/>a brilliant photograph and a perfect process .. so sharp .. stunning colours ... love the crop .. EXCELLENT .. love the title too .. <br/>it must be getting more and more difficult to get something on your profile page .. so congratulations again on another 7 and a deserving place on your profile page .. <br/>ahha  .. 40D .. a brilliant photographer with an excellent camera .. a great combo !! . :):)</td>', 'OMG OMG !!!FIRST PLACE .. CONGRATULATIONS ... !!!!!!!!!a brilliant photograph and a perfect process .. so sharp .. stunning colours ... love the crop .. EXCELLENT .. love the title too .. it must be getting more and more difficult to get something on your profile page .. so congratulations again on another 7 and a deserving place on your profile page .. ahha  .. 40D .. a brilliant photographer with an excellent camera .. a great combo !! . :):)', '2008-03-08 16:35:20.000000', NULL, 0),
