(4548743, 645335, 35357, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rex:</b></div><hr/><i> 29th place is great but IMO you were robbed.  This image is much better than most in front of you.  Very nice image.  How about some shot details? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks Rex, your taste is impeccable!  This bird was on a trainers arm at a winter festival.  It was dark behind the bird, and so the background is pretty much stopped-out.  I didn''t do any fancy editing other than some dodging &amp; burning here &amp; there on its feathers.<br/> <br/>I''m very pleased with this shot, and I think it''s one of my best ever.  I like it better than any of the top five shots on my profile page.</td>', 'Originally posted by rex: 29th place is great but IMO you were robbed.  This image is much better than most in front of you.  Very nice image.  How about some shot details?  Thanks Rex, your taste is impeccable!  This bird was on a trainers arm at a winter festival.  It was dark behind the bird, and so the background is pretty much stopped-out.  I didn''t do any fancy editing other than some dodging & burning here & there on its feathers. I''m very pleased with this shot, and I think it''s one of my best ever.  I like it better than any of the top five shots on my profile page.', '2008-03-08 17:13:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4548750, 652584, 1024, '<td valign="top">What a powerful photograph.  Diagonals alway lend a strong feeling to an image, but this one also have the feeling of stone and age.  This is truly an image for the times.<br/> <br/>Not to discount the powerful feeling of wonderful times and happy memories, but this transcends them.</td>', 'What a powerful photograph.  Diagonals alway lend a strong feeling to an image, but this one also have the feeling of stone and age.  This is truly an image for the times. Not to discount the powerful feeling of wonderful times and happy memories, but this transcends them.', '2008-03-08 17:15:52.000000', NULL, 0),
