(4549858, 644380, 34113, '<td valign="top">Exquisite hand on the pp controls. If you let the twig remain to contrast it with the finely detailed hare and thus set up a dynamic energy, you are masterful.   If not, the photo remains evidence of your mastery.</td>', 'Exquisite hand on the pp controls. If you let the twig remain to contrast it with the finely detailed hare and thus set up a dynamic energy, you are masterful.   If not, the photo remains evidence of your mastery.', '2008-03-09 11:30:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4549892, 653074, 15291, '<td valign="top">A very nice capture. I really like the use of angel here gives the image nice prosective. The compostion is outstanding as is the exposure. I also like the way it is all framed justt enough sand, foam, water &amp; clouds, Very well done. The turquosie color of the water is also outstanding. I also like the fact that you caught some motion in the water esp: in the sandy areas. Over all this is a fantastic image. Great capture.</td>', 'A very nice capture. I really like the use of angel here gives the image nice prosective. The compostion is outstanding as is the exposure. I also like the way it is all framed justt enough sand, foam, water & clouds, Very well done. The turquosie color of the water is also outstanding. I also like the fact that you caught some motion in the water esp: in the sandy areas. Over all this is a fantastic image. Great capture.', '2008-03-09 11:51:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4549917, 652800, 51793, '<td valign="top">Hey man thanks. I knew it was a good image the second I saw it. At first I thought you would get pinged for the little light that was coming through at the bottom but I don''t think anyone even saw it. 19th is AMAZING for a FS. I can think of 436 other people that would LOVE to be in 19th place??? <br/> <br/>I think the only reason why you got 19th was because there isn''t really any action going on here. No real WOW factor ya know. Don''t get me wrong it''s a PERFECT picture IMO but it''s a simple picture. I guess the average of everyone that voted thought that the other 18 images were more interesting. Only real problem is there can only be one 1st in every challenge. Sorry you didn''t get it but honestly it''s an amazing picture. You should add it to DPC Prints. I think you could sell this one.<br/></td>', 'Hey man thanks. I knew it was a good image the second I saw it. At first I thought you would get pinged for the little light that was coming through at the bottom but I don''t think anyone even saw it. 19th is AMAZING for a FS. I can think of 436 other people that would LOVE to be in 19th place???  I think the only reason why you got 19th was because there isn''t really any action going on here. No real WOW factor ya know. Don''t get me wrong it''s a PERFECT picture IMO but it''s a simple picture. I guess the average of everyone that voted thought that the other 18 images were more interesting. Only real problem is there can only be one 1st in every challenge. Sorry you didn''t get it but honestly it''s an amazing picture. You should add it to DPC Prints. I think you could sell this one.', '2008-03-09 12:18:45.000000', NULL, 0),
