(4550666, 653028, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well, I''ve not had any experience shooting architect/abstracts like this but... I personally don''t think it has enough interest to catch the viewer. Perhaps it could use some more color, contrast, and a more exciting composition. Excellent try though, it looks like this subject could have some good potential! :)</td>', 'Well, I''ve not had any experience shooting architect/abstracts like this but... I personally don''t think it has enough interest to catch the viewer. Perhaps it could use some more color, contrast, and a more exciting composition. Excellent try though, it looks like this subject could have some good potential! :)', '2008-03-09 20:07:53.000000', NULL, 0),
