(4550795, 653123, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love how the cow is defying gravity ;)  What is really really cool about this is how the cow head in the reflection seems to be cocked to one side as if it is trying to figure out what is going on.  Neat-o.</td>', 'I love how the cow is defying gravity ;)  What is really really cool about this is how the cow head in the reflection seems to be cocked to one side as if it is trying to figure out what is going on.  Neat-o.', '2008-03-09 21:35:37.000000', NULL, 0),
