(4550886, 652848, 90495, '<td valign="top">Did you try a high key glamour effect, just to see. This turned out very good. A bit more contrast might have given it an even more hollywood look. Great capture.</td>', 'Did you try a high key glamour effect, just to see. This turned out very good. A bit more contrast might have given it an even more hollywood look. Great capture.', '2008-03-09 22:06:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4550902, 645769, 67697, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this does not have any comments.  Hope I don''t ruin anything for you here lol. <br/> <br/>This is a beautiful photo.  I love all the red and I think the border is way cool.  Very fitting for the animated moment you captured.  I love the soft background too.</td>', 'I can''t believe this does not have any comments.  Hope I don''t ruin anything for you here lol.  This is a beautiful photo.  I love all the red and I think the border is way cool.  Very fitting for the animated moment you captured.  I love the soft background too.', '2008-03-09 22:11:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4550911, 652297, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m kind of laughing that you brought your camera on a date lol.  But I guess I am not surprised either.  How cute that you got to go see him! <br/> <br/>This photo has such a classic and nostalgic feel to it.  The soft white lighting all over is so very cool.  What a beautiful place to get together.</td>', 'I''m kind of laughing that you brought your camera on a date lol.  But I guess I am not surprised either.  How cute that you got to go see him!  This photo has such a classic and nostalgic feel to it.  The soft white lighting all over is so very cool.  What a beautiful place to get together.', '2008-03-09 22:15:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4550936, 652584, 67697, '<td valign="top">Well Jon, not sure what it would take to make this score higher, because I think it is a pretty good looking image.  That blue sky is indeed gorgeous!  It''s a great contrast to the designs of the building.  I love how you managed to capture so much detail and not blow anything out with that lighting.  Good for you for putting in something that makes you happy :)</td>', 'Well Jon, not sure what it would take to make this score higher, because I think it is a pretty good looking image.  That blue sky is indeed gorgeous!  It''s a great contrast to the designs of the building.  I love how you managed to capture so much detail and not blow anything out with that lighting.  Good for you for putting in something that makes you happy :)', '2008-03-09 22:24:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4550960, 652965, 67697, '<td valign="top">hmmm hmmm hmmm ok I think I like this one better than the color version BECAUSE you were trying to emphasize the play of light.  By minimizing the color choices, one cannot help but pay more attention to the streaks of light and what it is doing all over the room.  My favorite part tho is how the light turned into squiggles on the bedding.  And it looks like kitty is ready to pounce on it too lol.</td>', 'hmmm hmmm hmmm ok I think I like this one better than the color version BECAUSE you were trying to emphasize the play of light.  By minimizing the color choices, one cannot help but pay more attention to the streaks of light and what it is doing all over the room.  My favorite part tho is how the light turned into squiggles on the bedding.  And it looks like kitty is ready to pounce on it too lol.', '2008-03-09 22:36:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4551016, 648777, 73980, '<td valign="top">Just a down right exposure, well done!  I have a 40D but have not used the live view... I''ll actually have to play with it basded on your note that it was of use...  congrats on the blue.</td>', 'Just a down right exposure, well done!  I have a 40D but have not used the live view... I''ll actually have to play with it basded on your note that it was of use...  congrats on the blue.', '2008-03-09 22:57:37.000000', NULL, 0),
