(4561584, 643394, 36499, '<td valign="top">**Critique Club**<br/> <br/>You captured the snow flakes and thier textures extremly well! lighting is good but if you had an apture of 5 or there abouts you could have avoided that small hot spot. this photo has a good interest factor but doesnt fall in the rule of 1/3''s that dpc loves to see. the background is a bit busy but for me personaly i like it. I think it gives this shot interest and your subject connects to it. yor color and sharpness are done very well and even tho this didnt score what it should have i would be proud of it.<br/>if you have any questions please contact me.<br/>~~Cher~~</td>', '**Critique Club** You captured the snow flakes and thier textures extremly well! lighting is good but if you had an apture of 5 or there abouts you could have avoided that small hot spot. this photo has a good interest factor but doesnt fall in the rule of 1/3''s that dpc loves to see. the background is a bit busy but for me personaly i like it. I think it gives this shot interest and your subject connects to it. yor color and sharpness are done very well and even tho this didnt score what it should have i would be proud of it.if you have any questions please contact me.~~Cher~~', '2008-03-13 12:48:35.000000', NULL, 0),
