(4584818, 652893, 68586, '<td valign="top">Really nice portrait and PP work.<br/> <br/>Funny thing is the dog is taking centre stage sitting bolt upright and looking at the camera, while the little girl is leaning into ''his'' picture  :- )<br/> <br/>They look a charming couple though, there is a real air of friendship and relaxation here.</td>', 'Really nice portrait and PP work. Funny thing is the dog is taking centre stage sitting bolt upright and looking at the camera, while the little girl is leaning into ''his'' picture  :- ) They look a charming couple though, there is a real air of friendship and relaxation here.', '2008-03-25 05:19:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586321, 652869, 23002, '<td valign="top">I like this because it makes me wonder if I should look on the outside or the inside.  The one lonely person in this big, modern world is effective.</td>', 'I like this because it makes me wonder if I should look on the outside or the inside.  The one lonely person in this big, modern world is effective.', '2008-03-25 17:01:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586327, 652479, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great long exposure shot.  wonderful rich colours and a great composition.</td>', 'Great long exposure shot.  wonderful rich colours and a great composition.', '2008-03-25 17:02:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586331, 652333, 23002, '<td valign="top">Beautiful complimentary colours and the bug adds the finishing touch. :)</td>', 'Beautiful complimentary colours and the bug adds the finishing touch. :)', '2008-03-25 17:03:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586339, 650095, 23002, '<td valign="top">I definately like this one better than your outtake.  It is an amazing landscape photo, however with the person being hard to find I find it more distracting than a benefit.  If the person was the same size and position as in your outtake, but with this shot, it would be perfect. :)<br/> <br/>It must have been a wonderful experience to be out there amongst that kind of natural beauty.</td>', 'I definately like this one better than your outtake.  It is an amazing landscape photo, however with the person being hard to find I find it more distracting than a benefit.  If the person was the same size and position as in your outtake, but with this shot, it would be perfect. :) It must have been a wonderful experience to be out there amongst that kind of natural beauty.', '2008-03-25 17:05:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586345, 652913, 23002, '<td valign="top">Wow.  talk about leading lines!  I love the way the photo flows...the leading line then branching out into the horizon, making you view the sides of the shot, then the clouds above to complete it and add balance.</td>', 'Wow.  talk about leading lines!  I love the way the photo flows...the leading line then branching out into the horizon, making you view the sides of the shot, then the clouds above to complete it and add balance.', '2008-03-25 17:07:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586351, 653116, 23002, '<td valign="top">I like the leading line of the fence, the tree and the horse add good balance.</td>', 'I like the leading line of the fence, the tree and the horse add good balance.', '2008-03-25 17:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586356, 645384, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great slightly tilted composition and wonderful work on the exposure, which I would think would be tricky here.  Under rated in the challenge.</td>', 'Great slightly tilted composition and wonderful work on the exposure, which I would think would be tricky here.  Under rated in the challenge.', '2008-03-25 17:12:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586359, 653016, 23002, '<td valign="top">I love the look of concentration. :)</td>', 'I love the look of concentration. :)', '2008-03-25 17:13:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586367, 652993, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great choice for greyscale.  I think moving the guitar out of the way would make it stronger, but it is still a cool image.</td>', 'Great choice for greyscale.  I think moving the guitar out of the way would make it stronger, but it is still a cool image.', '2008-03-25 17:15:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586369, 653109, 23002, '<td valign="top">This is way under rated!  I love this shot. The old vs new theme, the balanced composition, subtle play between snow and soil, and the beautiful sky which is not "over cooked" like most we see here at dpc.</td>', 'This is way under rated!  I love this shot. The old vs new theme, the balanced composition, subtle play between snow and soil, and the beautiful sky which is not "over cooked" like most we see here at dpc.', '2008-03-25 17:17:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586371, 649537, 23002, '<td valign="top">Sir Thomas should be proud!  This is a very regal portrait, well suited for a feline of his stature. :)  Kitty noses and whiskers have always fascinated me, and the way his whiskers are contrasted by the darkened background on the viewing left of this photo makes them stand out nicely.</td>', 'Sir Thomas should be proud!  This is a very regal portrait, well suited for a feline of his stature. :)  Kitty noses and whiskers have always fascinated me, and the way his whiskers are contrasted by the darkened background on the viewing left of this photo makes them stand out nicely.', '2008-03-25 17:20:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586372, 644714, 23002, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light on this fancy female. A nice sharp image.</td>', 'Beautiful light on this fancy female. A nice sharp image.', '2008-03-25 17:21:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586374, 652130, 23002, '<td valign="top">A great expression of one boy vs the big bad world!  Well seen and a great idea to leave him as a silouhette instead of trying fill light.</td>', 'A great expression of one boy vs the big bad world!  Well seen and a great idea to leave him as a silouhette instead of trying fill light.', '2008-03-25 17:23:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586376, 652565, 23002, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit and well focused, very emotive actually. :)</td>', 'Beautifully lit and well focused, very emotive actually. :)', '2008-03-25 17:24:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586378, 650398, 23002, '<td valign="top">I like how the colours are all a bit muted to give the photo an overall moodiness.  I would have preferred to see the vase brought forward a few more inches to get the flowers farther from the wall however.  It looks like a painting.</td>', 'I like how the colours are all a bit muted to give the photo an overall moodiness.  I would have preferred to see the vase brought forward a few more inches to get the flowers farther from the wall however.  It looks like a painting.', '2008-03-25 17:26:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586380, 652994, 23002, '<td valign="top">Great image to capture the joy in their expressions.</td>', 'Great image to capture the joy in their expressions.', '2008-03-25 17:27:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586381, 645960, 23002, '<td valign="top">This shot was under rated in the challenge.  The wonderful warmth of the colours is comforting.</td>', 'This shot was under rated in the challenge.  The wonderful warmth of the colours is comforting.', '2008-03-25 17:28:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586390, 653123, 23002, '<td valign="top">This is another example of what I meant in my other comment about your ability to see things in many different ways and portray them all wonderfully.  I am much to timid as a photographer to submit a rotated photo, even if it does look better that way as this one does.  you have an incredible eye for taking an ordinary scene and making people see the beauty within it that they would have missed on their own.</td>', 'This is another example of what I meant in my other comment about your ability to see things in many different ways and portray them all wonderfully.  I am much to timid as a photographer to submit a rotated photo, even if it does look better that way as this one does.  you have an incredible eye for taking an ordinary scene and making people see the beauty within it that they would have missed on their own.', '2008-03-25 17:32:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586396, 652719, 23002, '<td valign="top">The tractor looks really good.  I do find the border to be a distraction though. :) Makes me want to farm, ok, maybe not, but it is a very nice image.</td>', 'The tractor looks really good.  I do find the border to be a distraction though. :) Makes me want to farm, ok, maybe not, but it is a very nice image.', '2008-03-25 17:34:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586403, 645486, 23002, '<td valign="top">One of those circumstances where there is way too much contrast for the camera to handle it, so you did the right thing and got the exposure on the child right and let the snow go white.  Unfortunately having that much white is a bit of a distraction from the child, who has nicely saturated colours.</td>', 'One of those circumstances where there is way too much contrast for the camera to handle it, so you did the right thing and got the exposure on the child right and let the snow go white.  Unfortunately having that much white is a bit of a distraction from the child, who has nicely saturated colours.', '2008-03-25 17:37:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586408, 652442, 23002, '<td valign="top">Very nicely seen to just shoot the legs, as that is the most powerful part of the horse (even as a statue) and I am sure also helped to eliminate a lot of distraction in the background as well.</td>', 'Very nicely seen to just shoot the legs, as that is the most powerful part of the horse (even as a statue) and I am sure also helped to eliminate a lot of distraction in the background as well.', '2008-03-25 17:39:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586410, 652978, 23002, '<td valign="top">I have always had mixed emotions about my own portrait shots where the subject is not facing square to the camera but it seems as though one eye is the center of the attention because of how it stares into the camera.  I think you have done a good job here of making it so obvious that everyone will know that it was intentional and not just something that happened.</td>', 'I have always had mixed emotions about my own portrait shots where the subject is not facing square to the camera but it seems as though one eye is the center of the attention because of how it stares into the camera.  I think you have done a good job here of making it so obvious that everyone will know that it was intentional and not just something that happened.', '2008-03-25 17:41:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586413, 652965, 23002, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you purposely defocused.  It certainly puts the emphasis on the entire photo as a play of light and lines, as opposed to simply a photo of a cat, although I am sure that would have been nice as well, just not as thought provoking.</td>', 'I like the fact that you purposely defocused.  It certainly puts the emphasis on the entire photo as a play of light and lines, as opposed to simply a photo of a cat, although I am sure that would have been nice as well, just not as thought provoking.', '2008-03-25 17:44:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586421, 649244, 23002, '<td valign="top">As you are already painfully aware, the lighting is a bit harsh.  It is a great example of the flower though, perfectly formed, colourful and not yet starting to wither like myself.  I actually have a thin, white umbrella that I have used in situations like this to shield the flower from the direct light and give it a softer, diffused look.</td>', 'As you are already painfully aware, the lighting is a bit harsh.  It is a great example of the flower though, perfectly formed, colourful and not yet starting to wither like myself.  I actually have a thin, white umbrella that I have used in situations like this to shield the flower from the direct light and give it a softer, diffused look.', '2008-03-25 17:47:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586437, 649085, 23002, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of the photo more than I do the technicals.  The mood is very pensive however the lighting does not match the mood because the lighting is fairly harsh.  A bit less contrast would also help put some detail into the shoulder area.</td>', 'I like the mood of the photo more than I do the technicals.  The mood is very pensive however the lighting does not match the mood because the lighting is fairly harsh.  A bit less contrast would also help put some detail into the shoulder area.', '2008-03-25 17:57:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586442, 652297, 23002, '<td valign="top">I love low light photography, and this is a fine example of it.  The overall classy feel to the shot, with the almost unearthly glow from the highlights make it a memorable shot.</td>', 'I love low light photography, and this is a fine example of it.  The overall classy feel to the shot, with the almost unearthly glow from the highlights make it a memorable shot.', '2008-03-25 17:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4586918, 650595, 88136, '<td valign="top">oooo i like this:) lots</td>', 'oooo i like this:) lots', '2008-03-25 21:45:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4587321, 650067, 54563, '<td valign="top">love this wow the action and movement perfect I love that it''s all dogs not so much sled</td>', 'love this wow the action and movement perfect I love that it''s all dogs not so much sled', '2008-03-26 00:26:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4591097, 648149, 51538, '<td valign="top">Quintessentially American in a nice sort of way.  Charming photo.  You certainly make that 40D sing in your hands...</td>', 'Quintessentially American in a nice sort of way.  Charming photo.  You certainly make that 40D sing in your hands...', '2008-03-27 10:36:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4593703, 645731, 30982, '<td valign="top">Meerkats have got to be the cutest most sociable creatures on the planet.  You got a nice catch of them here.</td>', 'Meerkats have got to be the cutest most sociable creatures on the planet.  You got a nice catch of them here.', '2008-03-28 12:56:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4593719, 652826, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous orchid!  The diagonal comp and the blooms yet to open support this very well.  Nice good color without being overdone and well-balanced background.</td>', 'What a gorgeous orchid!  The diagonal comp and the blooms yet to open support this very well.  Nice good color without being overdone and well-balanced background.', '2008-03-28 13:08:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4594305, 652236, 39850, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6.  I liked the concept, but wonder about a variation in angle/perspective to show the diving board (?) in more detail.</td>', 'I gave this a 6.  I liked the concept, but wonder about a variation in angle/perspective to show the diving board (?) in more detail.', '2008-03-28 18:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4601923, 652271, 80058, '<td valign="top">His posetur is FANTASTIC!! Brilliant capture, I love how its not entirely sharp too, can only show how fast he must have been! &lt;3</td>', 'His posetur is FANTASTIC!! Brilliant capture, I love how its not entirely sharp too, can only show how fast he must have been! <3', '2008-04-01 11:57:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4613516, 648149, 33068, '<td valign="top">Lighting and comp are spot on.  Well done.</td>', 'Lighting and comp are spot on.  Well done.', '2008-04-04 11:38:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4614350, 652322, 66193, '<td valign="top">Mark, just found this one.  Very nice shot. the colors are wonderful, and I love landscapes in portrait mode!</td>', 'Mark, just found this one.  Very nice shot. the colors are wonderful, and I love landscapes in portrait mode!', '2008-04-04 22:11:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4614587, 653092, 66515, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft dreamy feel to the shot. I think it deserved more than the 5.6 you received. I''d probably side with the commenters who took the time to a) look at the shot b)provide feedback<br/> <br/>...especially when they gave it a 6.8.<br/> <br/>Well done!</td>', 'I really like the soft dreamy feel to the shot. I think it deserved more than the 5.6 you received. I''d probably side with the commenters who took the time to a) look at the shot b)provide feedback ...especially when they gave it a 6.8. Well done!', '2008-04-04 23:18:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4616237, 649939, 47316, '<td valign="top">wow I like it. The X in the front gives just the right touch. It really lives one with the feeling of emptiness or the thought of how barren some places seem but they still have human interference.</td>', 'wow I like it. The X in the front gives just the right touch. It really lives one with the feeling of emptiness or the thought of how barren some places seem but they still have human interference.', '2008-04-05 13:05:02.000000', NULL, 0),
