(4982265, 653110, 16912, '<td valign="top">I''ll never understand the voters here at dpc, ok, its not a ''perfect'' shot technically but I doubt many people will ever see a sight like this in the wild let alone photograph it and that makes it very special. And, must go on to say my Zoo shot scored higher, it was easier to take and repeatable as I can go back every month and reshoot but doubt your shot will be reproduced - I hope its framed and on your wall Ernie!<br/> <br/>btw, got an 8 from me.</td>', 'I''ll never understand the voters here at dpc, ok, its not a ''perfect'' shot technically but I doubt many people will ever see a sight like this in the wild let alone photograph it and that makes it very special. And, must go on to say my Zoo shot scored higher, it was easier to take and repeatable as I can go back every month and reshoot but doubt your shot will be reproduced - I hope its framed and on your wall Ernie! btw, got an 8 from me.', '2008-09-30 19:45:01.000000', NULL, 0),
